helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218				0	en-ZA	Rulers display the dimensions of the page, and the position of tabs, indents, borders and columns. You can modify all of these on the rulers using the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
