helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414	2			0	en-ZA	The Status Bar contains information about the current document and offers various buttons with special functions. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id9648731				0	en-ZA	Language				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the language for the selected text. \<br/\>Click to open a menu where you can choose another language for the selected text or for the current paragraph. \<br/\>Choose None to exclude the text from spellchecking and hyphenation. \<br/\>Choose Reset to Default Language to re-apply the default language for the selection or the paragraph. \<br/\>Choose More to open a dialogue with more options.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
