helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id8070314				0	en-ZA	Zoom & View Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id7723929				0	en-ZA	Three controls on the Writer Status Bar allow to change the zoom and view layout of your text documents. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3666188				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The View Layout icons show from left to right: Single column mode. View mode with pages side by side. Book mode with two pages as in an open book.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8796349				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Drag the Zoom slider to the left to show more pages, drag to the right to zoom into a page and show a smaller area of the page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
