helpcontent2	source\text\shared\fontwork_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Fontwork Character Spacing dialogue where you can enter a new character spacing value.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\fontwork_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN10638				0	en-ZA	Value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\fontwork_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN1063C				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the Fontwork character spacing value.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
