helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904265639				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts the coefficient of determination R² value.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362614				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a single data label.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362666				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the chart legend.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362777				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected axis.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362785				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the major grid.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362748				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the minor grid.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362778				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes all data labels.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362893				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the trendline equation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362896				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the R² value.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904362827				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected data label.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904431376				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the mean value line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id081020090443142				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the Y error bars.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904393229				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Resets the selected data point to default format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200904393351				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Resets all data points to default format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	$[officename] Chart Features				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150543				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/schart/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Chart Features\"\>$[officename] Chart Features\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	en-ZA	Charts allow you to present data so that it is easy to visualize.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	en-ZA	You can create a chart from source data in a Calc spreadsheet or a Writer table. When the chart is embedded in the same document as the data, it stays linked to the data, so that the chart automatically updates when you change the source data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153143				0	en-ZA	Chart Types				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	en-ZA	Choose from a variety of 3D charts and 2D charts, such as bar charts, line charts, stock charts. You can change chart types with a few clicks of the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149665				0	en-ZA	Individual Formatting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	en-ZA	You can customise individual chart elements, such as axes, data labels, and legends, by right-clicking them in the chart, or with toolbar icons and menu commands.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
