helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0102.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Edit				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156385				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0102.xhp\" name=\"Edit\"\>Edit\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	en-ZA	The commands in this menu are used to edit formulae. In addition to basic commands, (for example, copying contents) there are functions specific to $[officename] Math such as searching for placeholders or errors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	File				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0101.xhp\" name=\"File\"\>File\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959				0	en-ZA	This menu contains the general commands for working with formula documents, such as open, save and print.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148489				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>Open\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
