helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148840				0	en-ZA	Use a Wizard to create interactive documents, such as professional letters and faxes, into which you can insert your saved formulae.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153251				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>Save As\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
