helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143269				0	en-ZA	Have a look at \<link href=\"http://www.dmaths.org\"\>www.dmaths.org\</link\> for a set of additional %PRODUCTNAME Math icons and macros.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156396				0	en-ZA	Help about the Help				2002-02-02 02:02:02
