helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151183				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01160400.xhp\" name=\"AutoAbstract to Presentation\"\>AutoAbstract to Presentation\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
