helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149801				0	en-ZA	Included Outline Levels				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153667				0	en-ZA	Enter the number of outline levels to include in the new presentation. For example, if you choose one level, only the paragraphs that follow the "Heading 1" paragraph style are included.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154478				0	en-ZA	Subpoints per Level				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145580	6			0	en-ZA	Enter the number of paragraphs that you want to include below each outline level (heading). 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
