helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147094				0	en-ZA	Per page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983	28			0	en-ZA	Restarts the numbering of footnotes at the top of each page. This option is only available if the \<emph\>End of page \</emph\>check box is selected in the \<emph\>Position \</emph\>area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	en-ZA	Per chapter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152766				0	en-ZA	Restarts the numbering of footnotes at the beginning of each chapter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155147				0	en-ZA	Per document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153347				0	en-ZA	Numbers the footnotes in the document sequentially.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149167				0	en-ZA	Start at				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156268	34			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTEOPTION:FLD_OFFSET\"\>Enter the number for the first footnote in the document. This option is only available if you selected "Per Document" in the \<emph\>Counting \</emph\>box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151036				0	en-ZA	Before				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150587				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FOOTNOTEOPTION:ED_PREFIX\"\>Enter the text that you want to display in front of the footnote number in the note text.\</ahelp\> For example, type "To " to display "To 1".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156364				0	en-ZA	After				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155906				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FOOTNOTEOPTION:ED_SUFFIX\"\>Enter the text that you want to display after the footnote number in the note text.\</ahelp\> For example, type ")" to display "1)".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148875				0	en-ZA	Position				2002-02-02 02:02:02
