helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155871				0	en-ZA	Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150695				0	en-ZA	To ensure a uniform appearance for the footnotes in your document, assign a paragraph style to the footnotes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
