helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Outline & Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151173				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030800.xhp\" name=\"Numbering\"\>Outline & Numbering\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154100				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NUMPARA\"\>Adds or removes outline level, numbering, or bullets from the paragraph. You can also select the style of numbering to use, and reset the numbering in a numbered list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536	14			0	en-ZA	To change the numbering options for paragraphs that use the same paragraph style, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and \</emph\>Formatting, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles \</emph\>icon. Right-click the style in the list, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline & Numbering\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470	26			0	en-ZA	To change the numbering options for selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline & Numbering\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id1209200804371034				0	en-ZA	Outline level				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id1209200804371097				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Assigns an outline level from 1 to 10 to the selected paragraphs or Paragraph Style.\</ahelp\> Select \<emph\>Body text\</emph\> to reset the outline level.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143283				0	en-ZA	Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154188				0	en-ZA	Numbering Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_NUMPARA:LB_NUMBER_STYLE\"\>Select the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130004.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Style\"\>Numbering Style\</link\> that you want to apply to the paragraph.\</ahelp\> These styles are also listed in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window if you click the \<emph\>Numbering Style\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149106				0	en-ZA	This section only appears when you edit the properties of the current paragraph by choosing \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151250				0	en-ZA	Restart at this paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154831				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:TP_NUMPARA:CB_NEW_START\"\>Restarts the numbering at the current paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147096				0	en-ZA	Start with				2002-02-02 02:02:02
