helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge08.xhp	0	help	par_idN1060E				0	en-ZA	The Plain text and HTML message formats are sent in the body of the message, whereas the *.odt, *.doc, and *.pdf formats are sent as attachments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
