helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148774				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"seitetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PageDialog\"\>Specify the formatting styles and the layout for the current page style, including page margins, headers and footers, and the page background.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Footer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147403				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04230000.xhp\" name=\"Footer\"\>Footer\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149353				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageFooter\"\>Adds or removes a footer from the page style that you select in the submenu. The footer is added to all of the pages that use the same page style.\</ahelp\> In a new document, only the "Default" page style is listed. Other page styles are added to the list after you apply them in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id7026276				0	en-ZA	The footers are visible only when you view the document in print layout (enable \<emph\>View - Print Layout\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150018				0	en-ZA	A tick mark is displayed in front of the page styles that have footers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150566				0	en-ZA	To remove a footer, choose \<emph\>Insert - Footer\</emph\>, and then select the page style containing the footer. The footer is removed from all of the pages that use this page style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153923				0	en-ZA	To add or remove footers from all of the page styles that are in use in the document, choose \<emph\>Insert - Footer - All\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151187				0	en-ZA	To format a footer, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05040300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Page - Footer\"\>\<emph\>Format - Page - Footer\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
