helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150096				0	en-ZA	Previous				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148784				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Jumps to the previous item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".\</ahelp\>Jumps to the previous item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154616				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154622\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20186.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154622\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150659				0	en-ZA	Previous Object				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150675				0	en-ZA	Next				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154028	32			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Jumps to the next item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>\<emph\>Navigation\</emph\>\</link\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".\</ahelp\>Jumps to the next item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3150773\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20175.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150773\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155359				0	en-ZA	Next Object				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148715				0	en-ZA	Page number				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155548				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX16\"\>Type the number of the page number that you want to jump to, and then press Enter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148933	74			0	en-ZA	To quickly move the cursor to another page while you are in a document, press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F5, type the number of the page that you want to jump to, and then wait a few moments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155308				0	en-ZA	List Box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155325	8			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX7\"\>Shows or hides the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
