helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	bm_id				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>AutoCorrect function;headings\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>headings;automatic\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>separator lines;AutoCorrect function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155962				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150200.xhp\" name=\"Apply\"\>Apply\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoFormatApply\"\>Automatically formats the file according to the options that you set under \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>            \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147404				0	en-ZA	When you apply automatic formats, the following rules apply:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	en-ZA	AutoCorrect for Headings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154505				0	en-ZA	A paragraph is formatted as a heading when the following conditions are met:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	en-ZA	paragraph begins with a capital letter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	en-ZA	paragraph does not end with a punctuation mark				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	en-ZA	empty paragraph above and below the paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149030				0	en-ZA	AutoCorrect for Bullets / Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	en-ZA	To create a bulleted list, type a hyphen (-), star (*), or plus sign (+), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763	18			0	en-ZA	To create a numbered list, type a number followed by a period (.), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147507				0	en-ZA	Automatic numbering is only applied to paragraphs formatted with the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\>, \<emph\>Text body\</emph\> or \<emph\>Text body indent\</emph\> paragraph styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152941				0	en-ZA	AutoCorrect for Separator Lines				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	en-ZA	If you type three or more hyphens (---), underscores (___) or equal signs (===) on line and then press Enter, the paragraph is replaced by a horizontal line as wide as the page. The line is actually the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"lower border\"\>lower border\</link\> of the preceding paragraph. The following rules apply:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530				0	en-ZA	Three hyphens (-) yield a single line (0.05 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	en-ZA	Three underscore (_) yield a single line (1 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150982				0	en-ZA	Three equal signs (=) yield a double line (1.10 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Editing Tables Using the Keyboard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154506				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>tables; editing with the keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"tabelle_tastatur\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090201.xhp\" name=\"Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\"\>Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145244				0	en-ZA	You can resize and delete table columns with the keyboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150564				0	en-ZA	Resizing Columns and Rows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153920				0	en-ZA	To resize a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down Alt, and then press the left or the right arrow. To resize the column without changing the width of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the left or the right arrows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147566				0	en-ZA	To increase the left indent of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150759				0	en-ZA	To resize a row, place the cursor in the row, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the up or the down arrows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149286				0	en-ZA	To move the table downwards on the page, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	en-ZA	Inserting and deleting columns or rows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	en-ZA	To insert a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	en-ZA	To delete a column, place the cursor in the column that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	en-ZA	To insert a row, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153531				0	en-ZA	To delete a row, place the cursor in the row that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150983				0	en-ZA	To change the behaviour of tables in a text document, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Table\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</link\>\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0204.xhp\" name=\"Table Bar\"\>Table Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Convert Text to Table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147402				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>converting; text, into tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text; converting to tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; converting to text\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147402				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06090000.xhp\" name=\"Convert Text to Table\"\>Convert Text to Table\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145829				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"texttab\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertTableText\"\>Converts the selected text into a table, or the selected table into text.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015				0	en-ZA	The options available in this dialogue depending on the type of conversion.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145247				0	en-ZA	Separate text at				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148388				0	en-ZA	A separator, such as a tab, marks the column boundaries in the selected text. Each paragraph in the selection is converted into a row in the table. Similarly, when you convert a table into text, the column markers are changed to the character that you specify, and each row is converted into a separate paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150936				0	en-ZA	Tabs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_CONV_TEXT_TABLE:CB_TAB\"\>Converts the text to a table using tabs as column markers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147171				0	en-ZA	Semicolons				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147565				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_CONV_TEXT_TABLE:CB_SEMI\"\>Converts the text to a table using semi-colons (;) as column markers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151273				0	en-ZA	Paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154645				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_CONV_TEXT_TABLE:CB_PARA\"\>Converts the text to a table using paragraphs as column markers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151184				0	en-ZA	Other:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150256				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_CONV_TEXT_TABLE:RB_OTHER\"\>Converts the text to a table using the character that you type in the box as a column marker.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149295				0	en-ZA	Text box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_CONV_TEXT_TABLE:ED_OTHER\"\>Type the character that you want to use as a column marker.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147508				0	en-ZA	Equal width for all columns				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154278				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_CONV_TEXT_TABLE:CB_KEEPCOLUMN\"\>Creates columns of equal width, regardless of the position of the column marker.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150703				0	en-ZA	AutoFormat				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id31542781				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\> dialogue, where you can select a predefined layout for table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
