helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154505				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148391				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Use the Styles and Formatting window to apply, create, edit, add, and remove formatting styles. Double-click an entry to apply the style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0122200903183687				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Choose Edit Paragraph Style in the context menu of a paragraph to edit the style of all paragraphs of the same style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	en-ZA	To \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> the Styles and Formatting window, drag its title bar to the left or to the right side of the workspace. To undock the window, double-click a free space on its toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147167				0	en-ZA	How to apply a style:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151264				0	en-ZA	Select the text. To apply a Character Style to one word, click the word. To apply a Paragraph Style, click the paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150756				0	en-ZA	Double-click the style in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	en-ZA	You can assign shortcut keys to Styles on the \<emph\>Tools - Customize - Keyboard\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
