helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154569				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_ENDNOTEOPTION:LB_PAGE_TEMPL\"\>Select the page style that you want to use for endnotes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155901				0	en-ZA	Character Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
