helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159188				0	en-ZA	Manual				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155180	24			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FORMAT_TABLE:RB_FREE\"\>Horizontally aligns the table based on the values that you enter in the \<emph\>Left\</emph\> and \<emph\>Right\</emph\> boxes in the\<emph\> Spacing\</emph\> area.\</ahelp\> $[officename] automatically calculates the table width. Select this option if you want to specify the individual \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090200.xhp\" name=\"column widths\"\>column widths\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149824				0	en-ZA	Spacing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149102				0	en-ZA	Left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154836	28			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FORMAT_TABLE:ED_LEFT_DIST\"\>Enter the amount of space that you want to leave between the left page margin and the edge of the table.\</ahelp\> This option is not available if the \<emph\>Automatic \</emph\>or the \<emph\>Left\</emph\> option is selected in the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
