helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145782				0	en-ZA	To insert a paragraph before a table at the beginning of a document, header or footer, place the cursor before any content in the first cell, and then press Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
