helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145828				0	en-ZA	Click in a table cell, or select the cells that you want to format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153006				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>Table - AutoFormat\</emph\>, and then click the format that you to want to apply.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145585				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148386				0	en-ZA	Format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149022				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_AUTOFMT_TABLE:LB_FORMAT\"\>Lists the available formatting styles for tables. Click the format that you want to apply, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153722				0	en-ZA	Add				2002-02-02 02:02:02
