helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154646				0	en-ZA	Format a table in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156320				0	en-ZA	Select the table, and then choose \<emph\>Table - AutoFormat\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153156				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151168				0	en-ZA	In the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05150101.xhp\" name=\"Add AutoFormat\"\>\<emph\>Add AutoFormat\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue, enter a name, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147516				0	en-ZA	Delete				2002-02-02 02:02:02
