helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_AUTOFMT_TABLE:BTN_BORDER\"\>Includes border styles in the selected table style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
