helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Input Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147515				0	en-ZA	Input Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146041				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FLD_INPUT\"\>Inserts a text field that you can open and edit by clicking it in the document.\</ahelp\> You can use input fields for text, or to assign a new value to a variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470				0	en-ZA	To change the content of an Input Field in a document, click the field, and then edit the text in the lower box of the dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153669				0	en-ZA	Edit				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154571				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:MULTILINEEDIT:DLG_FLD_INPUT:ED_EDIT\"\>The upper box displays the name that you entered in the \<emph\>Reference\</emph\> box of the Input Field on the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab of the \<emph\>Fields\</emph\> dialogue. The lower box displays the contents of the field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155897				0	en-ZA	Next				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149691				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_FLD_INPUT:PB_NEXT\"\>Jumps to the next input field in the document.\</ahelp\> This button is only available when you position the cursor directly before an input field, and then press Shift+Ctrl+F9.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Select Address List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10542				0	en-ZA	Select Address List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10549				0	en-ZA	Select the address list that you want to use for \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge03.xhp\"\>mail merge\</link\>, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055A				0	en-ZA	Add				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the database file that contains the addresses that you want to use as an address list.\</ahelp\> If the file contains more than one table, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_seltab.xhp\"\>Select Table\</link\> dialogue opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10573				0	en-ZA	Create				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_newaddlis.xhp\"\>New Address List\</link\> dialogue, where you can create a new address list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059A				0	en-ZA	Filter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059E				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12090100.xhp\"\>Standard Filter\</link\> dialogue , where you can apply filters to the address list to display the recipients that you want to see.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AF				0	en-ZA	Edit				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B3				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_newaddlis.xhp\"\>New Address List\</link\> dialogue, where you can edit the selected address list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	en-ZA	Change Table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C8				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_seltab.xhp\"\>Select Table\</link\> dialogue, where you can select another table to use for mail merge.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149353				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>tables;sorting rows\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sorting;paragraphs/table rows\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; sorting paragraphs\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines of text; sorting paragraphs\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sorting;paragraphs in special languages\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Asian languages;sorting paragraphs/table rows\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
