helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge03.xhp	0	help	par_id7805413				0	en-ZA	When you edit some records in a Calc spreadsheet data source that is currently in use for a mail merge, those changes are not visible in the mail merge.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
