helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	en-ZA	To edit an index entry, place the cursor in front of the index field, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Index Entry\</emph\>\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
