helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153540				0	en-ZA	New doc.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154473				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_ENVELOP_PRINT\"\>Creates a new document and inserts the envelope.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
