helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id7174596				0	en-ZA	Right-click the field on the status line that shows "Envelope".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id7657704				0	en-ZA	A submenu opens showing some page styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
