helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147733				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_LISTNAME\"\>Enter a unique name for the \<emph\>Input list\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146332				0	en-ZA	Choose Item				2002-02-02 02:02:02
