helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147602				0	en-ZA	Edit				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3148855				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_FLD_DROPDOWN_PB_EDIT\"\>Displays the \<emph\>Edit Fields: Functions\</emph\> dialogue, where you can edit the \<emph\>Input list\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155558				0	en-ZA	Next				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3148434				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_FLD_DROPDOWN_PB_NEXT\"\>Closes the current \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> and displays the next, if available.\</ahelp\> You see this button when you open the \<emph\>Choose Item\</emph\> dialogue by Ctrl+Shift+F9.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
