helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154505				0	en-ZA	You can assign different paragraph styles to change the formatting of index titles, separators and index entries. You can also modify paragraph styles in this dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
