helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	en-ZA	Inserts the name of the author, and the date, or the time of the last save.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3150108				0	en-ZA	Editing time				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3155860				0	en-ZA	Inserts the amount of time spent on editing a document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
