helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3145262				0	en-ZA	Document number				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3150556				0	en-ZA	Inserts the version number of the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3146326				0	en-ZA	Created				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149833				0	en-ZA	Inserts the name of the author, and the date, or the time when the document was created.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
