helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154784				0	en-ZA	Inserts the contents of the info fields found on the \<emph\>User Defined \</emph\>tab of the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01100300.xhp\" name=\"File - Properties\"\>\<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3150177				0	en-ZA	Last printed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3156094				0	en-ZA	Inserts the name of the author, and the date or time that the document was last printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
