helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3150912				0	en-ZA	Inserts the keywords as entered in the \<emph\>Description \</emph\>tab of the \<emph\>File Properties \</emph\>dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
