helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154642				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"literaturvz\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertAuthoritiesEntry\"\>Inserts a bibliography reference.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
