helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151332				0	en-ZA	Alphabetical numbering with identical capital letters, where the number of letters indicates the chapter level. For example, the second number in level three is "BBB".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
