helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149820				0	en-ZA	Alphabetical numbering with identical lower case letters, where the number of letters indicates the chapter level. For example, the third number in level two is "cc".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
