helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Styles in Writer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id4005249				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>styles;categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>character styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraph styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>frames; styles\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering;style categories\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150344				0	en-ZA	Styles in Writer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052				0	en-ZA	The following information concerns Writer styles that you can apply using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015				0	en-ZA	If you want, you can edit the styles of the current document, and then save the document as a template. To save the document as template, choose \<emph\>File - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"Templates - Save\"\>\<emph\>Templates - Save\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150572				0	en-ZA	Style Category				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153721				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:RID_STYLECATALOG:BT_TOOL\"\>These are the different categories of formatting styles.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151271				0	en-ZA	Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153154				0	en-ZA	Description				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172	6			0	en-ZA	Character Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	en-ZA	Use Character Styles to format single characters, or entire words and phrases. If you want, you can nest Character Styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150713	8			0	en-ZA	Paragraph Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	en-ZA	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308				0	en-ZA	Frame Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147527				0	en-ZA	Use Frame Styles to format text and graphic frames.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	en-ZA	Page Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897				0	en-ZA	Use Page Styles to organise the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196	63			0	en-ZA	Numbering Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149298	64			0	en-ZA	Use Numbering Styles to format numbered or bulleted lists.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149821				0	en-ZA	Style Groups				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154828				0	en-ZA	These are the style groups that you can display in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
