helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114				0	en-ZA	Displays formatting styles for text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150700				0	en-ZA	Chapter Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
