helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154774				0	en-ZA	Displays the user-defined conditional styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151090				0	en-ZA	Hierarchical				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148448				0	en-ZA	Displays the styles in the selected category in a hierarchical list. To view the styles in a sublevel, click on the plus sign (+) next to the sublevel name.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
