helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149827				0	en-ZA	Page number				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:NUMERICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_EXT_PARAGRAPH:ED_PAGENUM\"\>Enter the page number that you want to appear on the first page after the break. If you want to use the current page numbering, select "0".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
