helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154563				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_REL_HEIGHT\"\>Calculates the height of the selected object as a percentage of the height of the page text area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151313				0	en-ZA	Keep ratio				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153675				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_FIXEDRATIO\"\>Maintains the height and width ratio when you change the width or the height setting.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
