helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_AUTOHEIGHT\"\>Automatically adjusts the width or height of a frame to match the contents of the frame. If you want, you can specify a minimum width or minimum height for the frame.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> option is only available when you select a frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155144				0	en-ZA	Anchor				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153352				0	en-ZA	Specify the anchoring options for the selected object or frame. The anchor options are not available when you open the dialogue from the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156269				0	en-ZA	To page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
