helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151028				0	en-ZA	To paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_RADIOBUTTON_TP_FRM_STD_RB_ANCHOR_PARA\"\>Anchors the selection to the current paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
