helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149230				0	en-ZA	You can see the result of the alignments options that you select in the Preview box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147746				0	en-ZA	Mirror on even pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146337				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_MIRROR\"\>Reverses the current horizontal alignment settings on even pages.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148446				0	en-ZA	You can also use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060300.xhp\" name=\"Graphics\"\>\<emph\>Graphics\</emph\>\</link\> flip options to adjust the layout of objects on even and odd pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145310				0	en-ZA	Vertical				2002-02-02 02:02:02
