helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155862				0	en-ZA	Setup				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147418				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_ENV_PRT:BTN_PRTSETUP\"\>Opens the Print Setup dialogue where you can define additional printer settings, such as paper format and orientation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Edit Sections				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153673				0	en-ZA	Edit Sections				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"bereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditRegion\"\>Changes the properties of sections defined in your document.\</ahelp\> To insert a section, select text or click in your document, and then choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143275				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Edit Sections\</emph\> dialogue is similar to the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue, and offers the following additional options:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149820				0	en-ZA	Section				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149104	5			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Type the name of the section that you want to edit, or click a name in the \<emph\>Section \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\> If the cursor is currently in a section, the section name is displayed on the right side of the status bar at the bottom of the document window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	en-ZA	The current write protection status of a section is indicated by the lock symbol in front of the section name in the list. An open lock is unprotected and a closed lock is protected. Similarly, visible sections are indicated by a glasses symbol.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153638				0	en-ZA	Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040501.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue, where you can edit the column layout, background, footnote and endnote behaviour of the selected section.\</ahelp\> If the section is password protected, you must enter the password first.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155143				0	en-ZA	Remove				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_DISMISS\"\>Removes the selected section from the document, and inserts the contents of the section into the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Footnote				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154767				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040600.xhp\" name=\"Footnote\"\>Footnote\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149351				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FOOTNOTE_PAGE\"\>Specifies the layout options for footnotes, including the line that separates the footnote from the main body of document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154646				0	en-ZA	Footnote area				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151168				0	en-ZA	Set the height of the footnote area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145412				0	en-ZA	Not larger than page area				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:RB_MAXHEIGHT_PAGE\"\>Automatically adjusts the height of the footnote area depending on the number of footnotes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154099				0	en-ZA	Maximum Footnote Height				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149807				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets a maximum height for the footnote area. Enable this option, then enter the height.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154568				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:ED_MAXHEIGHT\"\>Enter the maximum height for the footnote area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151318				0	en-ZA	Distance from text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:ED_DIST\"\>Enter the amount of space to leave between the bottom page margin and the first line of text in the footnote area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155897				0	en-ZA	Separator Line				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149689				0	en-ZA	Specifies the position and length of the separator line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154194				0	en-ZA	Position				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155184				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:DLB_LINEPOS\"\>Select the horizontal alignment for the line that separates the main text from the footnote area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284				0	en-ZA	Length				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154827				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:ED_LINEWIDTH\"\>Enter the length of the separator line as a percentage of the page width area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151253				0	en-ZA	Weight				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149105				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:DLB_LINETYPE\"\>Select the formatting style for the separator line. If you do not want a separator line, choose "0.0 pt".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149828				0	en-ZA	Spacing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148970				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:ED_LINEDIST\"\>Enter the amount of space to leave between the separator line and the first line of the footnote area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155145				0	en-ZA	To specify the spacing between two footnotes, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph\</item\>, and then click the \<emph\>Indents & Spacing\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
