helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintLayout\"\>Displays how the document will look when you print it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
