helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143232				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/04250000.xhp\" name=\"Sum\"\>Sum\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146899				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoSum\"\>Activates the sum function. Note that the cursor must be in the cell where you want the sum to appear.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154504				0	en-ZA	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> recognises the cell range for the sum function as long as the cells are filled with numbers. Prior to entering the data, you must enable the \<emph\>Number Recognition\</emph\> in the context menu of the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\> to accept the sum formula as it appears in the entry line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
