helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\shortcut_writing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156112	6			0	en-ZA	You can also press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B, type the text that you want to format in bold, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+B when you are finished.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
