helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147410				0	en-ZA	You can only rotate text that is contained in a drawing object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153130				0	en-ZA	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars- Drawing\</item\> to open the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drawing\</item\>               \<emph/\>toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149866	68			0	en-ZA	Select the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Text\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text\</item\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149600\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_texttoolbox.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149600\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149590				0	en-ZA	Drag in your document to draw the text object, and then type your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154415	71			0	en-ZA	Click outside of the object, then click the text you entered. Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/05090000.xhp\" name=\"Object Rotation Mode\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Rotate\</item\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3145405\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145405\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drawing Object Properties\</item\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154252				0	en-ZA	Drag one of the corner handles of the text object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154844				0	en-ZA	You can also right-click the text object, choose \<emph\>Position and Size\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Rotation\</emph\> tab, and then enter a rotation angle or a new position for the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155888				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Show Draw Functions\"\>Show Draw Functions\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Inserting an Entire Text Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155185				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>sections;inserting external content\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text documents;merging\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>links;inserting text documents as\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;text documents\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155185				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"textdoc_inframe\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/textdoc_inframe.xhp\" name=\"Inserting an Entire Text Document\"\>Inserting an Entire Text Document\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id1812799				0	en-ZA	To Insert a Text File				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	en-ZA	Place the cursor in the document where you want to insert the file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>Insert - File\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149839				0	en-ZA	Locate the text document that you want to insert, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3148858				0	en-ZA	The contents of the text document are embedded into the current document and are not updated if the source file is changed. If you want the contents to automatically update when you change the source document, insert the file as a link.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156105				0	en-ZA	To Insert an Entire Text Document as a Link				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3150096				0	en-ZA	Place the cursor in the document where you want to insert the file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	en-ZA	Type a name in the \<emph\>New Section\</emph\> box, and then select the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	en-ZA	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File Name\</item\>               \<emph/\>box, type the name of the file that you want to insert, or click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and locate the file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	en-ZA	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the\<emph/\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sections\</item\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149619				0	en-ZA	If you want, set the formatting options for the section.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149862				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	en-ZA	$[officename] automatically updates the contents of the inserted section whenever the source document is changed. To manually update the contents of the section, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Update All\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
