helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id7355265				0	en-ZA	You can define a background colour or use a graphic as a background for various objects in $[officename] Writer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	en-ZA	To Apply a Background To Text Characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	en-ZA	Select the characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
