helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	en-ZA	Click the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab, select the background colour.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153541				0	en-ZA	To Apply a Background To a Paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
