helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_form.xhp	0	help	par_id3154259				0	en-ZA	You can apply different paragraph styles, assign hyperlinks to entries, change the layout of indexes, and change the background colour of indexes in the \<emph\>Insert Index\</emph\> dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_form.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155888				0	en-ZA	To Apply a Different Paragraph Style to an Index Level				2002-02-02 02:02:02
