helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	User Defined Borders in Text Documents 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	bm_id6737876				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>borders;for text tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells;borders in text tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>defining;table borders in Writer\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>frames;around text tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables;defining borders\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	hd_id3614917				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"borders\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/borders.xhp\"\>User Defined Borders in Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1069368				0	en-ZA	You can apply a variety of different cell borders to selected cells in a Writer table and to the whole table. Other objects in text documents can have user defined borders, too. For example, you can assign borders to page styles, to frames, and to inserted pictures or charts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id6527298				0	en-ZA	Select the cell or a block of cells in a Writer table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id6129947				0	en-ZA	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table - Table properties\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id8141117				0	en-ZA	In the dialogue, click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id6016418				0	en-ZA	Choose the border options you want to apply and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id5282448				0	en-ZA	The options in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area can be used to apply multiple border styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
