helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id2544328				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id2298654\" src=\"res/helpimg/border_wr_3.png\" width=\"1.4071in\" height=\"1.7791in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2298654\"\>column selected border\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
