helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	en-ZA	Select the graphic, right-click, and then choose \<emph\>Wrap - Edit Contour\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3150231				0	en-ZA	Use the tools to draw a new contour, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Apply\</item\>               \<emph/\>icon (green check mark).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
