helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149489				0	en-ZA	There are several ways to create a table in a text document. You can insert a table from a toolbar, through a menu command, or from a spreadsheet. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
