helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147416				0	en-ZA	On the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153398				0	en-ZA	In the table grid, drag to select the numbers of rows and columns that you want, and then release.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	en-ZA	To cancel, drag to the other side until \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> appears in the preview area of the grid.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
