helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145280				0	en-ZA	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Pages\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Then\</item\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
