helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	en-ZA	Use the arrow buttons in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Fields\</item\>         \<emph/\>dialogue to browse through the cross-references in the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
