helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147833	2			0	en-ZA	By default, $[officename] automatically corrects many common typing errors and applies formatting while you type. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081B				0	en-ZA	To quickly undo an automatic correction or completion, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN10846				0	en-ZA	To turn off most AutoCorrect features, remove the check mark from the menu \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - While Typing\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147251				0	en-ZA	To Remove a Word from the AutoCorrect List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147274				0	en-ZA	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	en-ZA	Click the \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145620				0	en-ZA	In the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list, select the word pair that you want to remove.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145645				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145668				0	en-ZA	To Stop Replacing Quotation Marks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151196				0	en-ZA	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151220				0	en-ZA	Click the \<emph\>Localized Options\</emph\> tab				2002-02-02 02:02:02
