helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155148				0	en-ZA	Clear the "Capitalize first letter of every sentence" check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155401				0	en-ZA	To Stop Drawing a Line When You Type Three Identical Characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155415				0	en-ZA	$[officename] automatically draws a line when you type three of the following characters and press Enter: - _ = * ~ #				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155439				0	en-ZA	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
