helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	en-ZA	You can insert the current date as a field that updates each time you open the document, or as a field that does not update.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147679				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	en-ZA	Click “Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\>               \<emph/\>list and do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	en-ZA	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click ”Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\>               \<emph/\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
