helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	en-ZA	The Navigator\<emph/\>displays the different parts of your document, such as headings, tables, frames, objects, or hyperlinks.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154247				0	en-ZA	To open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, press F5.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155878				0	en-ZA	To quickly jump to a location in your document, double-click an item listed in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> window or enter the respective page number in the spin box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3147108				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Docking and Resizing Windows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145088				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>Navigator;docking and resizing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Styles and Formatting window;docking and resizing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Gallery;docking and resizing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>docking; Navigator window\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resizing;windows\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145088				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"resize_navigator\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/resize_navigator.xhp\" name=\"Docking and Resizing Windows\"\>Docking and Resizing Windows\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155916				0	en-ZA	You can dock, undock and resize most $[officename] program windows such as the Navigator or the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	en-ZA	To dock or undock the Navigator or the Styles and Formatting window, hold down the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl\</item\> key and double-click on a grey area in the window. Alternatively, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Shift+F10\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3156096				0	en-ZA	To resize the window, drag a corner or an edge of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Creating a Document Template				2002-02-02 02:02:02
