helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149492				0	en-ZA	You can create a template to use as the basis for creating new text documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	en-ZA	Create a document and add the content and formatting styles that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	en-ZA	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Template\</item\>               \<emph/\>box, type a name for the new template.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	en-ZA	Select a template category in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\>               \<emph/\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	en-ZA	To create a document based on the template, choose\<emph/\>         \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - New - Templates and Documents\</item\>, select the template, and then click\<emph/\>         \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Open\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149636				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"File - Templates - Save\"\>File - Templates - Save\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
