helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	en-ZA	You can combine numbered lists into a single consecutively numbered list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149452				0	en-ZA	To Combine Consecutive Numbered Lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3154479				0	en-ZA	Select all of the paragraphs in the lists.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3155911				0	en-ZA	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\>               \<emph/\>icon twice.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	en-ZA	To Create a Numbered List From Non-consecutive Paragraphs:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	en-ZA	Hold down Ctrl and drag a selection in the first numbered paragraph. You only have to select one character.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	en-ZA	Continue to hold down Ctrl, and drag a selection in each numbered paragraph of the lists you want to combine.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3145102				0	en-ZA	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\>               \<emph/\>icon twice.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Adding Input Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
