helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155902				0	en-ZA	Always with current page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962	27			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTIONS_MISC:CBX_START_WITH_ACTUAL_PAGE\"\>Specifies that you always want a presentation to start with the current slide.\</ahelp\> Unmark\<emph\> Always with current page\</emph\> to always start a presentation with the first page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
