helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_OPREDLINE\"\>The\<emph\> Changes \</emph\>dialogue specifies various options for highlighting recorded changes in documents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	en-ZA	To record changes to your work, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Changes\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	en-ZA	Colour Definition for Changes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792				0	en-ZA	Defines colours for recorded changes. If you select the "By author" entry, $[officename] will automatically set the colour depending on the author who undertook the changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
