helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCPAGE_OPREDLINE:CLB_INSERT\"\>Specifies the colour to highlight insertions in a document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
