helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159151				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCPAGE_OPREDLINE:CLB_MOVE\"\>Specifies the colour to highlight moved cell contents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Text Document Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	en-ZA	%PRODUCTNAME Writer Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"optionentextdokument\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SwEditOptions\"\>These settings determine the way text documents that are created in $[officename] are handled. It is also possible to define settings for the current text document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The global settings are automatically saved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159399				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040300.xhp\" name=\"Basic Fonts (Western)\"\>Basic Fonts (Western)\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151385				0	en-ZA	Specifies the settings for the basic fonts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148563				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040300.xhp\" name=\"Basic Fonts (Asian)\"\>Basic Fonts (Asian)\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147304	4			0	en-ZA	Specifies the settings for the basic Asian fonts if Asian language support has been activated under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages.\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149294				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040300.xhp\" name=\"Basic Fonts (CTL)\"\>Basic Fonts (CTL)\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792				0	en-ZA	Specifies the settings for basic fonts for complex text layout languages if their support has been activated under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
