helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155764				0	en-ZA	Tile pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:TP_PRINT_OPTIONS:RBT_PAGETILE\"\>Specifies that pages are to be printed in tiled format. If the pages or slides are smaller than the paper, several pages or slides will be printed on one page of paper.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150388				0	en-ZA	Brochure				2002-02-02 02:02:02
