helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_SAVE\"\>In the\<emph\> General\</emph\> section, you can select default settings for saving documents, and can select default file formats.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
