helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXPAGE_GENERAL:ED_EMAIL\"\>Type your e-mail address.\</ahelp\> For example, my.name@my.provider.com				2002-02-02 02:02:02
