helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149667				0	en-ZA	Synchronise axes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147350				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_GRID:CBX_SYNCHRONIZE\"\>Specifies whether to change the current grid settings symmetrically.\</ahelp\> The resolution and subdivision for the X and Y axes remain the same.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4122135				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the visible grid in front of all objects.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1251869				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the snap lines in front of all objects.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id984221				0	en-ZA	Set the grid colour on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\"\>Appearance\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Browser Plug-in				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B7				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"mozilla\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020400.xhp\" name=\"Browser Plugin\"\>Browser Plug-in\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D5				0	en-ZA	Specifies to use the Mozilla plug-in to show %PRODUCTNAME documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D8				0	en-ZA	When you click any %PRODUCTNAME document hyperlink in your Mozilla or Netscape browser, one of the following can happen:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DE				0	en-ZA	The browser asks you whether you want to save the document on your disk, or whether you want to use an application to open the document. This request dialogue appears by default when you click any %PRODUCTNAME document hyperlink the first time and you did not enable the Browser Plug-in.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E2				0	en-ZA	The browser downloads the document to a temporary folder, then tells your system to run %PRODUCTNAME and open the document in %PRODUCTNAME. This is the default when you did not enable the Browser Plug-in and chose to open the document with %PRODUCTNAME when you were first asked.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E6				0	en-ZA	The browser opens a new browser window that shows some of the %PRODUCTNAME icons, and displays the document in the browser window. This is the default when you enable the Browser Plug-in. When you click the \<emph\>Edit File\</emph\> icon, a copy of the document is downloaded to a temporary folder on your disk, then %PRODUCTNAME starts and loads the copy for editing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F5				0	en-ZA	Display documents in browser				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F9				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"736117762\"\>Enables the Browser Plug-in to show %PRODUCTNAME documents in a browser window. Select, click OK, then restart your browser. Then, in the browser window, click any %PRODUCTNAME document hyperlink.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	en-ZA	The plug-in needs a version of Mozilla, Netscape, or Firefox installed on your system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Appearance				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153527				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>colours; appearance\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>options; appearance\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>appearance options\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153527				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\" name=\"Appearance\"\>Appearance\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the colours for the $[officename] user interface.\</ahelp\> You can save the current settings as colour scheme and load them later.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154046				0	en-ZA	Colour scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	en-ZA	Save and delete colour schemes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153252				0	en-ZA	Scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_COLORCONFIG_LB_COLORSCHEME\"\>Selects the colour scheme you want to use.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153665				0	en-ZA	Save				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_COLORCONFIG_PB_SAVESCHEME\"\>Saves the current settings as a colour scheme that you can reload later.\</ahelp\> The name is added to the \<emph\>Scheme\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149669				0	en-ZA	Name of colour scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_COLORCONFIG_NAME_SCHEME\"\>Enter a name for the colour scheme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152811				0	en-ZA	Delete				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_COLORCONFIG_PB_DELETESCHEME\"\>Deletes the colour scheme shown in the \<emph\>Scheme\</emph\> box. You cannot delete the Default scheme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148672				0	en-ZA	Scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149204				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_COLORCONFIG_COLORLIST_WIN\"\>Select the colours for the user interface elements.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	en-ZA	To apply a colour to a user interface element, ensure that the tick box in front of the name is marked. To hide a user interface element, clear the tick box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155430				0	en-ZA	Some user interface elements cannot be hidden.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	en-ZA	In order to enhance cursor visibility, if the user sets the application background colour between 40% and 60% grey, it is automatically changed to 40% grey.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153144				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> colour setting changes the user interface element to the preset colour from the colour scheme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154921				0	en-ZA	The colour settings for "Visited links" and "Unvisited links" only apply to documents created after the settings are applied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Sort Lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145382				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060400.xhp\" name=\"Sort Lists\"\>Sort Lists\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS\"\>All user-defined lists are displayed in the\<emph\> Sort Lists \</emph\>dialogue. You can also define and edit your own lists. Only text can be used as sort lists, no numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149416				0	en-ZA	Lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:LB_LISTS\"\>Displays all the available lists. These lists can be selected for editing.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147531				0	en-ZA	Entries				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:MULTILINEEDIT:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:ED_ENTRIES\"\>Displays the content of the currently selected list. This content can be edited.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145069				0	en-ZA	Copy list from				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:ED_COPYFROM\"\>Defines the spreadsheet and the cells to copy, in order to include them in the \<emph\>Lists\</emph\> box. The currently selected range in the spreadsheet is the default.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151211				0	en-ZA	Copy				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3158409				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_COPY\"\>Copies the contents of the cells in the \<emph\>Copy list from\</emph\> box. If you select a reference to related rows and columns, the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060401.xhp\" name=\"Copy List\"\>\<emph\>Copy List\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue appears after clicking the button. You can use this dialogue to define if the reference is converted to sort lists by row or by column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154684				0	en-ZA	New/Discard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153970				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_NEW\"\>Enters the contents of a new list into the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> This button will change from \<emph\>New\</emph\> to \<emph\>Discard\</emph\>, which enables you to delete the new list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144760				0	en-ZA	Add/Modify				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_ADD\"\>Adds a new list into the \<emph\>Lists\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> If you would like to edit this list in the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> box, this button will change from \<emph\>Add\</emph\> to \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, which enables you to include the newly modified list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156410				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>printing;formulae in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>title rows; printing in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formula texts; printing in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>frames; printing in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; in original size in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>original size; printing in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; fitting to pages in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>format filling printing in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; scaling in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>scaling; printing in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fitting to pages;print settings in Math\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150713				0	en-ZA	Settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"einst\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PRINT_OPTIONS\"\>Defines formula settings that will be valid for all documents.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159234				0	en-ZA	Print options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156410				0	en-ZA	Title				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156347				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_CHECKBOX_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_CB_TITLEROW\"\>Specifies whether you want the name of the document to be included in the printout.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166410				0	en-ZA	Formula text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_CHECKBOX_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_CB_EQUATION_TEXT\"\>Specifies whether to include the contents of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window at the bottom of the printout.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154046				0	en-ZA	Border				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149516				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Applies a thin border to the formula area in the printout.\</ahelp\> \<emph\>Title\</emph\> and \<emph\>Formula text\</emph\> are only set down by a frame if the corresponding check box is active.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153822				0	en-ZA	Print format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150503				0	en-ZA	Original size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153627				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_RB_ORIGINAL_SIZE\"\>Prints the formula without adjusting the current font size.\</ahelp\> It is possible that with large formulae a part of the command text is cut off.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	en-ZA	Fit to size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_RB_FIT_TO_PAGE\"\>Adjusts the formula to the page format used in the printout.\</ahelp\> The real size will be determined by the used paper format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153381				0	en-ZA	Scaling				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_METRICFIELD_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_MF_ZOOM\"\>Reduces or enlarges the size of the printed formula by a specified enlargement factor.\</ahelp\> Type the desired enlargement factor directly in the \<emph\>Scaling\</emph\> control, or set the value using the arrow buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147228				0	en-ZA	Other options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_CHECKBOX_RID_PRINTOPTIONPAGE_CB_IGNORE_SPACING\"\>Specifies that these space wildcards will be removed if they are at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> In earlier versions of $[officename], adding such characters at the end of a line prevented the right edge of the formula from being cut off during printing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010301.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Edit Paths				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150772				0	en-ZA	Edit Paths				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762	2			0	en-ZA	In the \<emph\>Edit Paths \</emph\>dialogue, you can select some folders that are available in $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147559				0	en-ZA	Paths				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153524				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXDLG_MULTIPATH:LB_MULTIPATH\"\>Contains a list of the paths that have already been added. Mark the default path for new files.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
