helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Defines the options for documents with complex text layouts.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145090				0	en-ZA	Sequence checking				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	en-ZA	In languages such as Thai, rules specify that certain characters are not allowed next to other characters. If Sequence Input Checking (SIC) is enabled, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> will not allow a character next to another if this is forbidden by a rule.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159234				0	en-ZA	Use sequence checking				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_CHECKBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_CB_SEQU_CHECK\"\>Enables sequence input checking for languages such as Thai.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10691				0	en-ZA	Restricted				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10695				0	en-ZA	Prevents the use as well as the printing of illegal character combinations.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166410				0	en-ZA	Cursor control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	en-ZA	Select the type of text cursor movement and text selection for mixed text (right-to-left mixed with left-to-right text direction).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	en-ZA	Logical				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_OPTIONS_CTL_RB_MOVEMENT_LOGICAL\"\>Pressing the Right Arrow key moves the text cursor toward the end of the current text. Pressing the Left Arrow key moves the text cursor toward the beginning of the current text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145317				0	en-ZA	Visual				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_OPTIONS_CTL_RB_MOVEMENT_VISUAL\"\>Pressing the Right Arrow key moves the text cursor in the right-hand direction. Pressing the Left Arrow key moves the text cursor in the left-hand direction.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157910				0	en-ZA	General options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159176				0	en-ZA	Numerals (in text only)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
