helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\java.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	en-ZA	Specifies the support options for Java applications in %PRODUCTNAME, including which Java Runtime Environment (JRE) to use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
