helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\java.xhp	0	help	par_idN10583				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"svx:CheckBox:RID_SVXPAGE_OPTIONS_JAVA:CB_JAVA_ENABLE\"\>Allows you to run Java applications in %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\> When a Java application attempts to access your hard drive, a prompt opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\java.xhp	0	help	par_idN10610				0	en-ZA	Java runtime environments (JRE) already installed:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
