helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTPRINT_PAGE\"\>Specifies print settings within a text or HTML document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153542				0	en-ZA	The print settings defined on this tab page apply to all subsequent print jobs, until you change the settings again. If you want to change the settings for the current print job only, use the \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156330				0	en-ZA	Contents				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628	4			0	en-ZA	Specifies which document contents are to be printed. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150771	7			0	en-ZA	Tables				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149294	9			0	en-ZA	Drawings (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3159150				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether to include colours and objects that are inserted to the background of the page (Format - Page - Background) in the printed document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150868				0	en-ZA	Print black				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id8004394				0	en-ZA	Hidden text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id2021546				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable this option to print text that is marked as hidden.\</ahelp\> The following hidden text is printed: text that is formatted as hidden by \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020200.xhp\"\>Format - Character - Font Effects - Hidden\</link\>, and the text fields \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\"\>Hidden text and Hidden paragraphs\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id2623981				0	en-ZA	Text placeholder				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id7242042				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable this option to print text placeholders. Disable this option to leave the text placeholders blank in the printout.\</ahelp\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\"\>Text placeholders\</link\> are fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151115				0	en-ZA	Pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	en-ZA	Defines the print order for $[officename] Writer documents with multiple pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150874				0	en-ZA	Left pages (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152885				0	en-ZA	Right pages (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148577				0	en-ZA	Reversed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147318				0	en-ZA	Brochure				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149410				0	en-ZA	If you print a document in portrait on a landscape page, two opposing sides in a brochure will be printed next to each other. If you have a printer with double-sided printing capability, you can create an entire brochure from your document without having to collate the pages later. If you have a printer that only has single-sided printing capability, you can achieve this effect by first printing the front pages with the "Front sides / right pages /odd pages" option marked, then re-inserting the entire paper stack in your printer and printing all the back pages with the "Back pages / left pages / even pages" option marked.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id9475386				0	en-ZA	Right to left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id7894222				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Check to print the pages of the brochure in the correct order for a right-to-left script.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149300				0	en-ZA	Comments				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151320				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether comments in your document are printed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148916				0	en-ZA	Other				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id4188055				0	en-ZA	Print automatically inserted blank pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id8295541				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If this option is enabled, automatically-inserted blank pages are being printed. This is best if you are printing double-sided. For example, in a book, a "chapter" paragraph style has been set to always start with an odd numbered page. If the previous chapter ends on an odd page, %PRODUCTNAME inserts an even numbered blank page. This option controls whether to print that even numbered page or not.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145642				0	en-ZA	Create single print jobs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156384				0	en-ZA	Paper tray from printer settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147362				0	en-ZA	Fax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154703				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_OPTPRINT_PAGE:LB_FAX\"\>If you have installed fax software on your computer and wish to fax directly from the text document, select the desired fax machine.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
