helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160201.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055A				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"1346114049\"\>Opens a file dialogue where you can select the database file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
