helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159411				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>disabled persons\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text colours for better accessibility\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>animations; accessibility options\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help tips; hiding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>high contrast mode\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>accessibility; options\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>options; accessibility\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159411				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01013000.xhp\" name=\"Accessibility\"\>Accessibility\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets options that make \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> programs more accessible for users with reduced sight, limited dexterity or other disabilities.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166460				0	en-ZA	Miscellaneous options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	en-ZA	Sets accessibility options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154750				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Support assistive technology tools (program restart required)\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ACCESSIBILITY_TOOL\"\>Allows you to use assistive tools, such as external screen readers, Braille devices or speech recognition input devices. The Java Runtime Environment must be installed on your computer before you can enable assistive support.\</ahelp\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154047				0	en-ZA	Use text selection cursor in read-only text document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_TEXTSELECTION\"\>Displays cursor in read-only documents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147531				0	en-ZA	Allow animated graphics				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ANIMATED_GRAPHICS\"\>Previews animated graphics, such as GIF images, in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	en-ZA	Allow animated text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ANIMATED_TEXTS\"\>Previews animated text, such as blinking and scrolling, in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153381				0	en-ZA	Help tips disappear after				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_TIPHELP\"\>Hides the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\" name=\"Help tips\"\>Help tips\</link\> after the number of seconds that you enter.\</ahelp\> Otherwise, Help tips are displayed until you press Escape or move the cursor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151043				0	en-ZA	Seconds				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_NUMERICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_NF_TIPHELP\"\>Enter the number of seconds to display the Help tips.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149809				0	en-ZA	Options for high contrast appearance				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153106				0	en-ZA	High contrast is an operating system setting that changes the system colour scheme to improve readability. You can decide how \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> uses the high contrast settings of the operating system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	en-ZA	Cell borders and shadows are always shown in text colour when high contrast mode is active. The cell background colour is ignored then.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	en-ZA	Automatically detect high contrast mode of operating system				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_AUTO_DETECT_HC\"\>Switches \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> into high contrast mode when the system background colour is very dark.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154918				0	en-ZA	Use automatic font colour for screen display				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_AUTOMATIC_FONT_COLOR\"\>Displays fonts in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> using the system colour settings. This option only affects the screen display.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153091				0	en-ZA	Use system colours for page previews				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_PAGE_PREVIEWS\"\>Applies the high contrast settings of the operating system to page previews.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Data sources options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201				0	en-ZA	Data sources options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3093440				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"daten\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Defines the general settings for the data sources in $[officename].\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Colour				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153126	1			0	en-ZA	Colour				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150771				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>defining;colours\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colours;selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colours;adding\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771	2			0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"farbentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to define your own colours using the two-dimensional graphic and numerical gradient chart.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to display the newly defined colour in the preview box of the \<emph\>Colours\</emph\> register, where you can then decide if you want to add or replace the new colour in the current colour palette.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149514	3			0	en-ZA	Colour Window				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061	4			0	en-ZA	In the two big colour windows, you click to select a new colour. You can select the colour in the left or the right colour window as you wish.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944	5			0	en-ZA	In the right colour window, you will see the entire colour spectrum from the left to the right, with the colours at the top being fully saturated and the colours at the bottom being unsaturated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670	6			0	en-ZA	In the left colour window, you will see a selection of colours, displaying a progressive spectrum, varying between the four colours in the four corners of this window. You can change the colours in the four corners as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758	7			0	en-ZA	Click the corner of the field in which you want to change the colour.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398	8			0	en-ZA	In the right colour window, click the desired new colour for the corner field or enter the values, which define the colour, in the numeric input fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210	9			0	en-ZA	Apply the colour selected on the right to the small field that is marked in the left colour window by clicking the \<emph\><--\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383	10			0	en-ZA	The gradient in the left colour window is immediately adjusted with respect to hue, saturation, and brightness.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id9701528				0	en-ZA	%PRODUCTNAME uses only the RGB colour model for printing in colour. The CMYK controls are provided only to ease the input of colour values using CMYK notation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153192	11			0	en-ZA	<--				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909	12			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_COLOR:BTN_1\"\>Click the \<emph\><--\</emph\> button to replace the selected colour in the colour palette with the colour selected at the right. The button is enabled when you select a colour in one of the four corners.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158409	13			0	en-ZA	-->				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043	14			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_COLOR:BTN_2\"\>Sets the small selection cursor in the right window on the colour, which corresponds to the selected colour in the left window and updates the respective values in the numerical fields.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149203	15			0	en-ZA	Cyan				2002-02-02 02:02:02
