helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153087				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Table\"\>Table\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTTABLE_PAGE\"\>Defines the attributes of tables in text documents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	en-ZA	Specifies the default settings for columns and rows and the table mode. Also specifies the standard values for moving and inserting columns and rows. For further information see \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090201.xhp\" name=\"Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\"\>Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\> in the $[officename] Writer Help\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149656				0	en-ZA	Default				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	en-ZA	Defines the defaults for all newly created text tables in text documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152922				0	en-ZA	Heading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_HEADER\"\>Specifies that the first row of the table is formatted with the "Table heading" Paragraph Style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147086				0	en-ZA	Repeat on each page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149204				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_REPEAT_HEADER\"\>Specifies whether the table heading is carried over onto the new page after a page break.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125864				0	en-ZA	Do not split (not in HTML)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_DONT_SPLIT\"\>Specifies that tables are not split by any type of text flow break.\</ahelp\> You can also find this option in menu \<emph\>Table - Table Properties - Text Flow\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148575				0	en-ZA	Border				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_BORDER\"\>Specifies that table cells have a border by default.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146976				0	en-ZA	Input in tables				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153142				0	en-ZA	Number recognition				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFORMATTING\"\>Specifies that numbers in a text table are recognised and formatted as numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	en-ZA	If \<emph\>Number recognition\</emph\> is not marked, numbers are saved in text format and are automatically left-aligned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856				0	en-ZA	Number format recognition				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159346	43			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFMT_FORMATTING\"\>If\<emph\> Number format recognition \</emph\>is not marked, only input in the format that has been set at the cell is accepted. Any other input resets the format to \<emph\>Text\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153876				0	en-ZA	Alignment				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMALIGNMENT\"\>Specifies that numbers are always bottom right aligned in the cell.\</ahelp\> If this field is not marked numbers are always top left aligned in the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792				0	en-ZA	Direct formatting is not influenced by the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> field. If you centre align the cell contents directly, they remain centred irrespective of whether text or numbers are involved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154360				0	en-ZA	Keyboard handling				2002-02-02 02:02:02
