helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153711	4			0	en-ZA	Defines the default settings for moving rows and columns with the keyboard. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155445				0	en-ZA	Row				2002-02-02 02:02:02
