helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150085				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the general settings for $[officename].\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153561				0	en-ZA	Year (two digits)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:NUMERICFIELD:OFA_TP_MISC:NF_YEARVALUE\"\>Defines a date range, within which the system recognises a two-digit year.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	en-ZA	In $[officename], years are indicated by four digits, so that the difference between 1/1/99 and 1/1/01 is two years. This \<emph\>Year (two digits)\</emph\> setting allows the user to define the years in which two-digit dates are added to 2000. To illustrate, if you specify a date of 1/1/30 or later, the entry "1/1/20" is recognised as 1/1/2020 instead of 1/1/1920.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148664				0	en-ZA	Help				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153525				0	en-ZA	Specifies the behaviour of the installed help.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DB				0	en-ZA	Tips				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DF				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the icon names and more bubble help information, for example, chapter names when you scroll through a document with chapters.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	en-ZA	Extended tips				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FA				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays a help text when you rest the cursor on an icon, a menu command, or a control on a dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154138				0	en-ZA	Help Agent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145174				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_CHECKBOX_OFA_TP_MISC_CB_HELPAGENT\"\>Specifies that the Help Agent will be displayed automatically in selected situations. Click the Help Agent window to see a Help page with information about the current context.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153968				0	en-ZA	Reset Help Agent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	en-ZA	If you have not opened the Help Agent for a particular situation three times in succession, but rather have closed it or let it close automatically, the Help Agent for this situation is not shown again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
