helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	en-ZA	Defines the maximum number of reverse steps allowed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153881				0	en-ZA	Number of steps				2002-02-02 02:02:02
