helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154015				0	en-ZA	K				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156180				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TPCOLOR_RGB_3\"\>Black\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156332				0	en-ZA	Add				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154481				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_COLOR:BTN_ADD\"\>Adds a new colour.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153708				0	en-ZA	Modify				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148916				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_COLOR:BTN_MODIFY\"\>Changes the current colour.\</ahelp\> Note that the colour is overwritten without a confirmation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154754				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010501.xhp\" name=\"Edit\"\>Edit\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159267				0	en-ZA	Load Colour List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154705	34			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_COLOR:BTN_LOAD\"\>Accesses the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> dialogue, which allows you to select a colour palette\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147344				0	en-ZA	Save Colour List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_COLOR:BTN_SAVE\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Save As\</emph\> dialogue, which enables you to save the current colour table under a specified name.\</ahelp\> If you do not choose this command, the current colour table will be automatically saved as default and re-loaded the next time you start $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572	38			0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Load colour list\</emph\> and \<emph\>Save colour list \</emph\>icons are visible only if you select the \<emph\>Colours\</emph\> tab with the \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\> command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Formatting Aids				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	bm_id3144510				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>non-printing characters (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>displaying; non-printing characters (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraph marks; displaying (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>characters; displaying only on screen (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>optional hyphens (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hyphens; displaying custom (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>custom hyphens (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spaces; displaying (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spaces; showing protected spaces (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>protected spaces; showing (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>non-breaking spaces (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tab stops; displaying (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>break display (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hidden text;showing (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hidden fields display (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; hidden paragraphs (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cursor; allowing in protected areas (Writer)\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154285				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Formatting Aids\"\>Formatting Aids\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155450				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTSHDWCRSR\"\>In $[officename] text and HTML documents, defines the display for certain characters and for the direct cursor.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144510				0	en-ZA	Display of				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	en-ZA	Defines which non-printing characters are visible on screen. Activate the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"Non-printing Characters On/Off\"\>\<emph\>Non-printing Characters\</emph\>\</link\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar. All characters that you have selected on the \<emph\>Formatting Aids\</emph\> tab page will be displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154140				0	en-ZA	Paragraph end				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_PARA\"\>Specifies whether paragraph delimiters are displayed. The paragraph delimiters also contain paragraph format information.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	en-ZA	Custom hyphens				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147230	32			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_SHYPH\"\>Specifies whether user-defined delimiters are displayed. These are hidden delimiters that you enter within a word by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Hyphen(-) \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Hyphen(-).\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> Words with user-defined delimiters are only separated at the end of a line at the point where a user-defined delimiter has been inserted, irrespective of whether the automatic hyphenation is activated or deactivated.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147287				0	en-ZA	Spaces				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_SPACE\"\>Specifies whether to represent every space in the text with a dot.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750				0	en-ZA	Non-breaking spaces				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3152938	36			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_HSPACE\"\>Specifies that non-breaking spaces are shown as grey boxes. Non-breaking spaces are not broken at the end of a line and are entered with the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Shift+Spacebar \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Shift+Spacebar\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> shortcut keys.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147348				0	en-ZA	Tabs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153574				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_TAB\"\>Specifies that tab stops are displayed as small arrows.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159154				0	en-ZA	Breaks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150874				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_BREAK\"\>Displays all line breaks inserted with the Shift+Enter shortcut. These breaks create a new line, but do not start a new paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E5				0	en-ZA	Hidden text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FB				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"sw:CheckBox:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:CB_CHAR_HIDDEN\"\>Displays text that uses the character format "hidden", when \<emph\>View - Non-printing Characters\</emph\> is enabled.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149481				0	en-ZA	Fields: Hidden text (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149413				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_HIDDEN\"\>Displays text that is hidden by \<emph\>Conditional Text\</emph\> or \<emph\>Hidden Text\</emph\> fields.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149300				0	en-ZA	Fields: Hidden paragraphs (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149418				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_HIDDEN_PARA\"\>If you have inserted text using the \<emph\>Hidden Paragraph\</emph\> field, specifies whether to display the hidden paragraph.\</ahelp\> This option has the same function as the menu commands \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03140000.xhp\" name=\"View - Hidden Paragraphs\"\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> available in open text documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156180				0	en-ZA	Direct cursor (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3146900				0	en-ZA	Defines all the properties of the direct cursor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154273				0	en-ZA	Direct cursor				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:CB_SHDWCRSONOFF\"\>Activates the direct cursor.\</ahelp\> You can also activate this function by clicking the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18130000.xhp\" name=\"Direct Cursor On/Off\"\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> icon in a text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152962				0	en-ZA	Insert (not for HTML document)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149020				0	en-ZA	Defines the insert options for the direct cursor. If you click at any position in your document, a new paragraph can be written or inserted exactly at this position. The properties of this paragraph depend on the selected option. You can select from the following options:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148995				0	en-ZA	Paragraph alignment				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	10			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLMARGIN\"\>Sets the paragraph alignment when the direct cursor is used. Depending on where the mouse is clicked, the paragraph is formatted left aligned, centred or right aligned. The cursor before the mouse-click shows, by means of a triangle, which alignment is set. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150387				0	en-ZA	Left paragraph margin				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151188	12			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLINDENT\"\>When the direct cursor is used, the left paragraph indent is set at the horizontal position where you click the direct cursor. The paragraph is left aligned. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145147				0	en-ZA	Tabs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155174				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLTAB\"\>When the direct cursor is used, as many tabs as necessary are added in the new paragraph until the clicked position is reached.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166449				0	en-ZA	Tabs and Spaces				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLSPACE\"\>When the Direct Cursor is used, a corresponding number of tabs and spaces are inserted in the new paragraph as necessary until the clicked position is reached.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149964				0	en-ZA	All insert options refer only to the current paragraph generated with the Direct Cursor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146134				0	en-ZA	Cursor in protected areas - Enabled				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147508				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:CB_ALLOW_IN_PROT\"\>Specifies that you can set the cursor in a protected area, but cannot make any changes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Improvement Program				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200912315340				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/improvement.xhp\"\>Improvement Program\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200312315378				0	en-ZA	The Improvement Program records some user interactions and sends them to the User Experience project.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594966				0	en-ZA	The Improvement Program was initiated by the User Experience project to improve the usability of %PRODUCTNAME. The User Experience project can be found at the OpenOffice.org web site: \<link href=\"http://ux.openoffice.org/\"\>http://ux.openoffice.org/\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594946				0	en-ZA	The second time you start your new %PRODUCTNAME software, you see a window that gives information about the Improvement Program. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094345				0	en-ZA	At this time you can choose to accept or deny your participation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id052620090409438				0	en-ZA	If you accept, data recording starts immediately. When you start a new session of %PRODUCTNAME, the collected data will be sent. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094433				0	en-ZA	If you deny to participate, no data will be sent and recording of data stops immediately.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594945				0	en-ZA	At any time, you can enable or disable the recording of user interaction data and the sending of these data. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Improvement Program\</item\>. Click the \<emph\>Info\</emph\> icon to browse to a web page with more information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594944				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>Yes, I am willing to participate …\</emph\> to enable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595080				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>No, I do not wish to participate\</emph\> to disable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595037				0	en-ZA	Tracked data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595096				0	en-ZA	The following data will be recorded and sent:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595033				0	en-ZA	Clicks on toolbar buttons, including extension toolbars 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595014				0	en-ZA	Execution of menu commands, including extension menus				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595145				0	en-ZA	Clicks on context menu commands				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595115				0	en-ZA	Fonts applied by using the menu 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595144				0	en-ZA	Font sizes applied by using the menu 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595146				0	en-ZA	Buttons, like OK, Cancel, etc. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595296				0	en-ZA	Document language and paragraph language applied by using the menu or status bar 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595242				0	en-ZA	Each recorded item also includes a time stamp and the module (Writer, Calc, Impress, …) where it has been called 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
