helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155766				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_CHECKBOX_OFA_TP_VIEW_CB_MENU_ICONS\"\>Displays icons next to the corresponding menu items. Select from "Automatic", "Hide" and "Show". "Automatic" displays icons according to system settings and themes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262				0	en-ZA	Show preview of fonts				2002-02-02 02:02:02
