helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010800.xhp	0	help	par_idN10962				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to restore the last used document view. Many view properties valid when the document was last saved will be restored.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
