helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156027				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030300.xhp\" name=\"Tabs\"\>Tabs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABULATOR\"\>Set the position of a tab stop in a paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	en-ZA	If you want, you can also use the ruler to set the tab positions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154897				0	en-ZA	Position				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153331				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:ED_TABPOS\"\>Select a tab stop type, enter a new measurement, and then click \<emph\>New\</emph\>. If you want, you can also specify the measurement units to use for the tab (cm for centimetre, or " for inches). Existing tabs to the left of the first tab that you set are removed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155180				0	en-ZA	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	en-ZA	Select the type of tab stop that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157910				0	en-ZA	Left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146847				0	en-ZA	The name of this tab stop is \<emph\>Left/Top\</emph\> if Asian language support is enabled.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_TABTYPE_LEFT\"\>Aligns the left edge of the text to the tab stop and extends the text to the right.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149763				0	en-ZA	Right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491				0	en-ZA	This name of this tab stop is \<emph\>Right/Bottom\</emph\> if Asian language support is enabled.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_TABTYPE_RIGHT\"\>Aligns the right edge of the text to the tab stop and extends the text to the left of the tab stop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153628				0	en-ZA	Center				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154347				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_TABTYPE_CENTER\"\>Aligns the centre of the text to the tab stop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148552				0	en-ZA	Decimal				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3144422				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_TABTYPE_DECIMAL\"\>Aligns the decimal point of a number to the centre of the tab stop and text to the left of the tab.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154388	19			0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>The character that is used as a decimal separator depends on the regional setting of your operating system. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153380				0	en-ZA	Character				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153778				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:ED_TABTYPE_DECCHAR\"\>Enter a character that you want the decimal tab to use as a decimal separator.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159151				0	en-ZA	Fill Character				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154153				0	en-ZA	Specify the characters to use as leader to the left of the tab stop.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144760				0	en-ZA	None				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143231				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_FILLCHAR_NO\"\>Inserts no fill characters, or removes existing fill characters to the left of the tab stop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152933				0	en-ZA	.......				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_FILLCHAR_POINTS\"\>Fills the empty space to the left of the tab stop with dots.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280				0	en-ZA	------				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_FILLCHAR_DASHLINE\"\>Fills the empty space to the left of the tab stop with dashes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157960				0	en-ZA	______				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_FILLCHAR_UNDERSCORE\"\>Draws a line to fill the empty space to the left of the tab stop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153770				0	en-ZA	Character				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150441				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_FILLCHAR_OTHER\"\>Allows you to specify a character to fill the empty space to the left of the tab stop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	en-ZA	New				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3163717				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_NEW\"\>Adds the tab stop that you defined to the current paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153945				0	en-ZA	Clear All				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145660				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_TABULATOR:BTN_DELALL\"\>Removes all of the tab stops that you defined under \<emph\>Position\</emph\>. Sets \<emph\>Left\</emph\> tab stops at regular intervals as the default tab stops.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Colour Bar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147477				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>colour bar\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paint box\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147477				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/03170000.xhp\" name=\"Color Bar\"\>Colour Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ColorControl\"\>Show or hides the \<emph\>Colour Bar\</emph\>. To modify or change the colour table that is displayed, choose \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>, and then click on the \<emph\>Colours\</emph\> tab.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_COLOR_CTL_COLORS\"\>Click the colour that you want to use. To change the fill colour of an object in the current file, select the object and then click a colour. To change the line colour of the selected object, right-click a colour. To change the colour of text in a text object, double-click the text-object, select the text, and then click a colour.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	en-ZA	You can also drag a colour from the \<emph\>Colour Bar\</emph\> and drop it on a draw object on your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147009				0	en-ZA	To detach the \<emph\>Colour Bar\</emph\>, click on a grey area of the toolbar and then drag. To reattach the \<emph\>Colour Bar\</emph\>, drag the title bar of the toolbar to the edge of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Align Right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
