helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151264				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AlignRight\"\>Aligns the right edges of the selected objects. If only one object is selected in Impress or Draw, the right edge of the object is aligned to the right page margin.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3144336				0	en-ZA	Objects are aligned to the right edge of the rightmost object in the selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
