helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3154350				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"\"\>Enter or edit file information for an \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06150000.xhp\" name=\"XML filter\"\>XML filter\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148668				0	en-ZA	DocType				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_DOCTYPE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the DOCTYPE of the XML file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	en-ZA	For example, the DOCTYPE defined for the current DocBook XML filter is:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	en-ZA	-//OASIS//DTD DocBook XML V4.1.2//EN				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3145829				0	en-ZA	The resulting line in the XML document is:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3152594				0	en-ZA	<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DocBook XML V4.1.2//EN" "http://www.oasis-open.org/docbook/xml/4.1.2/docbookx.dtd">				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	en-ZA	DTD				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_DTD\" visibility=\"visible\"\>If you want, enter the public or system identifier of the DTD (Document Type Definition) that you want to use.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3152867				0	en-ZA	If present, both identifiers are written to the DOCTYPE declaration in saved XML files.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	en-ZA	The public identifier is used to detect the filter when you open a file without specifying a filter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155338				0	en-ZA	Browse				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_IMPORT_TEMPLATE_BROWSE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Opens a file selection dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153527				0	en-ZA	XSLT for export				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3152552				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_EXPORT_XSLT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>If this is an export filter, enter the file name of the XSLT stylesheet that you want to use for exporting.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149149				0	en-ZA	XSLT for import				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_IMPORT_XSLT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>If this is an import filter, enter the file name of the XSLT stylesheet that you want to use for importing.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147242				0	en-ZA	Template for import				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153320				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_IMPORT_TEMPLATE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the name of the template that you want to use for importing. In the template, styles are defined to display XML tags.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3156330				0	en-ZA	The path to the directory that contains the template must be included in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Paths\</emph\>. When you open an XML file whose filter uses the template, the template opens first. In the template, you can map $[officename] styles to display XML tags in the XML document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Thesaurus				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146946				0	en-ZA	Thesaurus				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147366				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"thesaurustxt\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Thesaurus\"\>Opens a dialogue box to replace the current word with a synonym, or a related term.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154184				0	en-ZA	Thesaurus support is not available for all languages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	en-ZA	Current word				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the current word, or the related term that you selected by double-clicking a line in the Alternatives list. You can also type text directly in this box to look up your text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3647571				0	en-ZA	Arrow left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id369233				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Recalls the previous contents of the "Current word" text box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154983				0	en-ZA	Alternatives				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an entry in the Alternatives list to copy the related term to the "Replace with" text box. Double-click an entry to copy the related term to the "Current word" text box and to look up that term.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155892				0	en-ZA	Replace with				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150693				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The word or words in the "Replace with" text box will replace the original word in the document when you click the Replace button. You can also type text directly in this box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
