helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\formatting_mark.xhp	0	help	par_id9407330				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts an invisible hyphen within a word that will appear and create a line break once it becomes the last character in a line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
