helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154621				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>printing; documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>documents; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text documents; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations; print menu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>drawings; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>choosing printers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printers; choosing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>print area selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>selecting; print areas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pages; selecting one to print\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; selections\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; copies\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>copies; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spoolfiles with Xprinter\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154621				0	en-ZA	Print				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"druckentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Print\"\>Prints the current document, selection, or the pages that you specify. You can also set the print options for the current document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The printing options can vary according to the printer and the operating system that you use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912284853				0	en-ZA	The Print dialogue consists of three main parts: A preview with navigation buttons, several tab pages with control elements specific to the current document type, and the Print, Cancel, and Help buttons. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200901193992				0	en-ZA	If you just want to know how to print your document, click any of the following links.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531416				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Printing text documents:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531487				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Printing spreadsheets:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531410				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Printing presentations:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531449				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>General printing:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912284952				0	en-ZA	The settings that you define in the Print dialogue are valid only for the current print job that you start by clicking the Print button. If you want to change some options permanently, open Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME (application name) - Print.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156080				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>To set the default \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> printer options for text documents, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1099E				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>To set the default \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> printer options for spreadsheet documents, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060700.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Calc - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CD				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>To set the default \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>printer options for presentation documents, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Impress - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200901194137				0	en-ZA	Press Shift+F1 or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help - What's This?\</item\> and point to any control element in the Print dialogue to see an extended help text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912284914				0	en-ZA	Preview				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id081820091228505				0	en-ZA	The preview shows how each sheet of paper will look. You can browse through all sheets of paper with the buttons below the preview.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285056				0	en-ZA	General				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285064				0	en-ZA	On the General tab page, you find the most important control elements for printing. You can define which contents of your document are to be printed. You can select the printer and open the printer settings dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Prints the entire document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150244				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Prints only the selected area(s) or object(s) in the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the number of copies that you want to print.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150865				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Preserves the page order of the original document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens the printer properties dialogue. The printer properties vary according to the printer that you select.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904102910				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>For brochure printing, you can select a left-to-right order of pages or a right-to-left order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285074				0	en-ZA	%PRODUCTNAME Writer / Calc / Impress / Draw / Math				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285019				0	en-ZA	The tab page with the same name as the current application can be used to define the contents, colour, size, and pages to be printed. You define settings that are specific to the current document type.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285112				0	en-ZA	Page Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285150				0	en-ZA	The Page Layout tab page can be used to save some sheets of paper by printing several pages onto each sheet of paper. You define the arrangement and size of output pages on the physical paper.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904164735				0	en-ZA	Change the arrangement of pages to be printed on every sheet of paper. The preview shows how every final sheet of paper will look.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904102987				0	en-ZA	For some document types, you can choose to print a brochure.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285138				0	en-ZA	Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285146				0	en-ZA	On the Options tab page you can set some additional options for the current print job. Here you can specify to print to a file instead of printing on a printer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
