helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149783	46			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_ICONVIEW\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as icons.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
