helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153894				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/gallery.xhp\" name=\"Gallery\"\>Gallery\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Gallery\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, where you can select graphics and sounds to insert into your document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	44			0	en-ZA	You can display the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as icons, or icons with titles and path information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	en-ZA	To zoom in or zoom out on a single object in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, double-click the object, or select the object, and then press the Spacebar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3145346				0	en-ZA	Themes are listed on the left side of the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_THEMELIST\"\>Click a theme to view the objects associated with the theme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155355	50			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_WINDOW\"\>To insert a \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>object, select the object, and then drag it into the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156113				0	en-ZA	Adding a New File to the Gallery				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153032				0	en-ZA	To add a file to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, right-click a theme, choose \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Files \</emph\>tab, and then click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>. You can also click an object in the current document, hold, and then drag it to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145315				0	en-ZA	New theme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_NEWTHEME\"\>Adds a new theme to the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>and lets you choose the files to include in the theme.\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
