helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEDLG_STANDARD\"\>Displays the files and directories in the directory that you are in.\</ahelp\> To open a file, select the file, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159256				0	en-ZA	To open more than one document at the same time, each in an own window, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> while you click the files, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	en-ZA	Click a column header to sort the files. Click again to reverse the sort order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEVIEW_MENU_DELETE\"\>To delete a file, right-click the file, and then choose \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEVIEW_MENU_RENAME\"\>To rename a file, right-click the file, and then choose \<emph\>Rename\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153331				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_SVT_QUERYDELETE_BTN_YES\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to delete the file with the name shown in this dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3161458				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_SVT_QUERYDELETE_BTN_NO\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to cancel deletion of the file with the name shown in this dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147531				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_SVT_QUERYDELETE_BTN_ALL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to delete all selected files.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154280				0	en-ZA	File name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3161656				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEDLG_AUTOCOMPLETEBOX\"\>Enter a file name or a path for the file. You can also enter a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> that starts with the protocol name ftp, http, or https.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541	72			0	en-ZA	If you want, you can use wildcards in the \<emph\>File name \</emph\>box to filter the list of files that is displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153779	24			0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>For example, to list all of the text files in a directory, enter the asterisk wildcard with the text file extension (*.txt), and then click\<emph\> Open\</emph\>. Use the question mark (?) wildcard to represent any character, as in (??3*.txt), which only displays text files with a '3' as the third character in the file name.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145117				0	en-ZA	Version				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149291				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEOPEN_VERSION\"\>If there are multiple versions of the selected file, select the version that you want to open.\</ahelp\> You can save and organise multiple versions of a document by choosing \<emph\>File - Versions\</emph\>. The versions of a document are opened in read-only mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150767				0	en-ZA	File type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_LISTBOX_DLG_SVT_EXPLORERFILE_LB_EXPLORERFILE_FILETYPE\"\>Select the file type that you want to open, or select \<emph\>All Files (*)\</emph\> to display a list of all of the files in the directory.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154125				0	en-ZA	Open				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_SVT_EXPLORERFILE_BTN_EXPLORERFILE_OPEN\"\>Opens the selected document(s).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147085				0	en-ZA	Insert				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156293				0	en-ZA	If you opened the dialogue by choosing \<emph\>Insert - File\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> button is labelled \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEDLG_INSERT_BTN\"\>Inserts the selected file into the current document at the cursor position.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144762				0	en-ZA	Read-only				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEOPEN_READONLY\"\>Opens the file in read-only mode.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149984				0	en-ZA	Play				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147289				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILESAVE_DOPLAY\"\>Plays the selected sound file. Click again to stop playing the sound file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149260				0	en-ZA	Opening Documents With Templates				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145367	40			0	en-ZA	            \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> recognises templates that are located in any directory from the following list:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151292				0	en-ZA	the shared template directory				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144442				0	en-ZA	the user template directory \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>in the home directory\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>in the Documents and Settings directory\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146905				0	en-ZA	all template folders as defined in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010300.xhp\" name=\"%PRODUCTNAME - Paths\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</link\>\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id7375713				0	en-ZA	When you use \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Template - Save\</item\> to save a template, the template will be stored in your user template directory. When you open a document that is based on such a template, the document will be checked for a changed template as decribed below. The template is associated with the document, it may be called a "sticky template".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id6930143				0	en-ZA	When you use \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Save As\</item\> and select a template filter to save a template at any other directory that is not in the list, then the documents based on that template will not be checked.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150105				0	en-ZA	When you open a document that was created from a "sticky template" (as defined above), \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> checks to see if the template has been modified since the document was last opened. If the template was changed a dialogue is shown where you can select which styles to apply to the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153096				0	en-ZA	To apply the new styles from the template to the document, click \<emph\>Yes\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147581				0	en-ZA	To retain the styles that are currently used in the document, click \<emph\>No\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154988				0	en-ZA	If a document was created using a template that cannot be found a dialogue is shown that asks you how to proceed next time the document is opened.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	en-ZA	To break the link between the document and the missing template, click \<emph\>No\</emph\>, otherwise \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> will look for the template the next time you open the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149417				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/doc_open.xhp\" name=\"Opening Documents\"\>Opening Documents\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153848				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Import and Export Filters\"\>Import and Export Filters\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
