helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3143225				0	en-ZA	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>, a date with the value "0" corresponds to Dec 30, 1899.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	en-ZA	Time Formats				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150108				0	en-ZA	To display hours, minutes and seconds use the following number format codes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149158				0	en-ZA	Format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154341				0	en-ZA	Format Code				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154557				0	en-ZA	Hours as 0-23				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156348				0	en-ZA	h				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3143218				0	en-ZA	Hours as 00-23				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155266				0	en-ZA	hh				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150139				0	en-ZA	Minutes as 0-59				2002-02-02 02:02:02
