helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Paste\"\>Inserts the contents of the clipboard at the location of the cursor, and replaces any selected text or objects.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147834	5			0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>In a spreadsheet, when you paste a range of cells from the clipboard, the result depends on the current selection: If only one cell is selected, the cell range will be pasted started from that cell. If you mark a cell range wider than the cell range in the clipboard, the cell range will be pasted repeatedly to fill the selected cell range. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
