helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149669				0	en-ZA	File type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343	40			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILESAVE_FILETYPE\"\>Select the file format for the document that you are saving.\</ahelp\>In the display area, only the documents with this file type are displayed. File types are described in \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Information on Import and Export Filters\"\>Information on Import and Export Filters\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116				0	en-ZA	Always save your document in a \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> file type before saving it to an external file type. When you export to an external file type, some formatting features may be lost.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147228				0	en-ZA	Save				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154068				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILESAVE_DOSAVE\"\>Saves the file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145744				0	en-ZA	Save with password				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145152				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILESAVE_SAVEWITHPASSWORD\"\>Protects the file with a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/password_dlg.xhp\" name=\"password\"\>password\</link\> that must be entered before a user can open the file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920				0	en-ZA	Only documents using the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> XML-based format can be saved with a password.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147502				0	en-ZA	Edit filter settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152883				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILESAVE_CUSTOMIZEFILTER\"\>Allows you to set the spreadsheet saving options for some types of data files.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154988				0	en-ZA	Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159125				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILESAVE_SELECTION\"\>Exports only the selected graphic objects in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw and Impress to another format. If this box is not checked, the entire document is exported.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148577				0	en-ZA	If you are exporting to any document file type, the entire document is exported.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
