helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158409				0	en-ZA	Use dynamic spacing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3144760	35			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_FOOTER_CB_DYNSPACING\"\>Overrides the \<emph\>Spacing \</emph\>setting and allows the footer to expand into the area between the footer and document text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
