helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146148				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_STD_PARAGRAPH:ED_TOPDIST\"\>Enter the amount of space that you want to leave above the selected paragraph(s).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145590				0	en-ZA	Below paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
