helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150496				0	en-ZA	If you save your document in MS Word format, all of the strikethrough styles are converted to the single line style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151226				0	en-ZA	Underlining				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_CHAR_EFFECTS_LB_UNDERLINE\"\>Select the underlining style that you want to apply. To apply the underlining to words only, select the \<emph\>Individual Words\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153147				0	en-ZA	If you apply underlining to a superscript text, the underlining is raised to the level of the superscript. If the superscript is contained in a word with normal text, the underlining is not raised.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
