helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156282	65			0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Objects \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810	66			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCDLG_INSCONT_BTN_INSOBJECTS\"\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Inserts objects contained within the selected cell range. These can be OLE objects, chart objects, or drawing objects. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
