helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149748				0	en-ZA	Specify the AutoCorrect options for quotation marks and for options that are specific to the language of the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id31537173				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to apply the replacements while you type [T], or when you modify existing text [M].\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159300				0	en-ZA	Add non breaking space before specific punctuation marks in French text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153173				0	en-ZA	Inserts a non breaking space before ";", "!", "?" and ":" when the character language is set to French (France, Belgium, Luxembourg, Monaco, or Switzerland) and before ":" only when the character language is set to French (Canada).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159400				0	en-ZA	Format ordinal number suffixes (1st ... 1^st)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154173				0	en-ZA	Formats the text characters of ordinals, such as 1st, 2nd, or 3rd, as superscripts. For example, in English text, 1st will be converted to 1^st.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154682				0	en-ZA	Single quotes / Double quotes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
