helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154380				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"zentrierttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Horizontally centres the contents of the cell.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
