helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"blocktext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AlignBlock\"\>Aligns the contents of the cell to the left and to the right cell borders.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
