helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070A				0	en-ZA	Sets the PDF export options for images inside your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071B				0	en-ZA	EPS images with embedded previews are exported only as previews. EPS images without embedded previews are exported as empty placeholders.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	en-ZA	Lossless compression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10719				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects a lossless compression of images. All pixels are preserved.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10730				0	en-ZA	JPEG compression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10734				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects a JPEG compression of images. With a high quality level, almost all pixels are preserved. With a low quality level, some pixels get lost and artefacts are introduced, but file sizes are reduced.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
