helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id3946958				0	en-ZA	Export automatically inserted blank pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id8551896				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If switched on, automatically inserted blank pages are being exported to pdf file. This is best if you are printing the pdf file double-sided. Example: In a book a chapter paragraph style is set to always start with an odd numbered page. The previous chapter ends on an odd page. %PRODUCTNAME inserts an even numbered blank page. This option controls whether to export that even numbered page or not.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
