helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156194				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Minimum space numbering <-> text\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
