helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152821				0	en-ZA	You can also change the width of a column by dragging the divider beside the column header.\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\> \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\> To fit the column width to the cell contents, double-click the divider.\</caseinline\> \</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
