helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	en-ZA	Open file read-only				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AE				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to allow this document to be opened in read-only mode only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B1				0	en-ZA	This file sharing option protects the document against accidental changes. It is still possible to edit a copy of the document and save that copy with the same name as the original.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B4				0	en-ZA	Record changes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to enable recording changes. This is the same as \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	en-ZA	To protect the recording state with a password, click \<emph\>Protect\</emph\> and enter a password. Other users of this document can apply their changes, but they cannot disable change recording without knowing the password.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D0				0	en-ZA	Protect / Unprotect				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D4				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"703992336\"\>Protects the change recording state with a password. If change recording is protected for the current document, the button is named \<emph\>Unprotect\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Unprotect\</emph\> and type the correct password to disable the protection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
