helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\webhtml.xhp	0	help	par_id8309274				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a temporary copy of the current document in HTML format, opens the system default Web browser, and displays the HTML file in the Web browser.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\webhtml.xhp	0	help	par_id9186681				0	en-ZA	The HTML formatted copy is written to the temporary files folder that you can select in \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</item\>. When you quit %PRODUCTNAME, the HTML file will be deleted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\webhtml.xhp	0	help	par_id5871150				0	en-ZA	You can set the HTML export filter options by choosing \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML Compatibility\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
