helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156045				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100100.xhp\" name=\"Similarity Search\"\>Similarity Search\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146856	53			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXDLG_SEARCH_CB_SIMILARITY\"\>Find terms that are similar to the \<emph\>Search for \</emph\>text. Select this checkbox, and then click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to define the similarity options.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149551	66			0	en-ZA	For example, a similarity search can find words that differ from the \<emph\>Search for \</emph\>text by two characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
