helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3187353				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The automatic view layout displays pages side by side, as many as the zoom factor allows.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
