helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1993774				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>In columns view layout you see pages in a given number of columns side by side. Enter the number of columns.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
