helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_BACKGROUND_MF_COL_TRANS\"\>Set the transparency for the background colour or graphic of a frame, where 100% is completely transparent and 0% is opaque. When you increase the transparency of the background, the underlying text or objects become visible through the background of the frame.\</ahelp\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
