helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140100.xhp	0	help	par_idN108C6				0	en-ZA	A keyboard accelerator allows you to select a menu command when you press Alt+ an underlined letter in a menu command. For example, to select the \<emph\>Save All\</emph\> command by pressing Alt+V, enter Sa~ve All. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
