helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150838				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_NAME\"\>Enter the name that you want to display in the list box of the \<emph\>XML Filter Settings\</emph\> dialogue.\</ahelp\> You must enter a unique name.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149119				0	en-ZA	Application				2002-02-02 02:02:02
