helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149999				0	en-ZA	Name of file type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149549				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_INTERFACE_NAME\"\>Enter the name that you want to display in the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box in file dialogues.\</ahelp\> You must enter a unique name. For import filters, the name appears in the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box of \<emph\>Open\</emph\> dialogues. For export filters, the name appears in the \<emph\>File format\</emph\> box of \<emph\>Export\</emph\> dialogues.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147834				0	en-ZA	File extension				2002-02-02 02:02:02
