helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145356				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the anchoring options for the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	en-ZA	If the selected object is in a frame, you can also anchor the object to the frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
