helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146873				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TRANS_ANGLE\"\>Rotates the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148983				0	en-ZA	Pivot point				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150902				0	en-ZA	The selected object is rotated around a pivot point that you specify. The default pivot point is at the centre of the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153528				0	en-ZA	If you set a pivot point too far outside of the object boundaries, the object could be rotated off of the page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
