helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154926				0	en-ZA	The exceptions that you define depend on the current language setting. If you want, you can change the language setting by selecting a different language in the \<emph\>Replacements and exceptions for language\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
