helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05990000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150467				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"texttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextAttributes\"\>Sets the layout and anchoring properties for text in the selected drawing or text object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05990000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150620				0	en-ZA	This command is only available for drawing objects that can contain text, for example for rectangles, but not for lines.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
