helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750	13			0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>AutoUpdate \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
