helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149956				0	en-ZA	Bottom				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_GRFCROP_MF_BOTTOM\"\>If the \<emph\>Keep Scale\</emph\> option is selected, enter a positive amount to trim the bottom of the graphic, or a negative amount to add white space below the graphic. If the \<emph\>Keep image size\</emph\> option is selected, enter a positive amount to increase the vertical scale of the graphic, or a negative amount to decrease the vertical scale of the graphic.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
