helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFAPAGE_AUTOFORMAT_CLB\"\>Select the options for automatically correcting errors as you type, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	en-ZA	In text documents, you can choose to apply the AutoCorrect corrections while you type [T], or only when you modify existing text [M] with \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - Apply\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id7547227				0	en-ZA	When you choose to modify existing text with all options deselected, still all "Default" paragraph styles will be converted to "Text body" styles. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154398				0	en-ZA	Use replacement table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151234				0	en-ZA	If you type a letter combination that matches a shortcut in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"replacement table\"\>replacement table\</link\>, the letter combination is replaced with the replacement text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150144				0	en-ZA	Correct TWo INitial CApitals				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	en-ZA	If you type two uppercase letters at the beginning of a "WOrd", the second uppercase letter is automatically replaced with a lowercase letter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156426				0	en-ZA	Capitalise first letter of every sentence.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	en-ZA	Capitalises the first letter of every sentence.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id5240028				0	en-ZA	The first letter in a Calc cell will never be capitalised automatically.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	en-ZA	Automatic *bold* and _underline_				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	en-ZA	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	en-ZA	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150275				0	en-ZA	URL Recognition				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	en-ZA	Automatically creates a hyperlink when you type a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
