helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147317				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153224				0	en-ZA	Opens the list of the control field currently selected in a dialogue. These shortcut keys apply not only to combo boxes but also to icon buttons with pop-up menus. Close an opened list by pressing the Escape key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
