helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156377				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+N				2002-02-02 02:02:02
