helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_CHKPROTECT\"\>Specifies that sheet protection will be disabled during conversion and thereafter re-enabled. If sheet protection is covered by a password, you will see a dialogue for entering the password.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
