helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144766				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Euro Converter\</emph\> dialogue contains the following functions:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148387				0	en-ZA	Entire document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150113				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_CHECKBOX1\"\>Converts the entire document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159110				0	en-ZA	Currencies				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148834				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_COMBOBOX1\"\>Specifies the currency to be converted into euros.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155084				0	en-ZA	Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	en-ZA	Select the cells you want to convert in this range, if you did not mark the \<emph\>Entire document\</emph\> check box. Select an option and then click the desired entries in the \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> / \<emph\>Currency ranges\</emph\> field. The selected range will be visible as such in the document. Click \<emph\>Convert\</emph\> to carry out the conversion.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
