helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	en-ZA	The settings you select for the export will be automatically saved as a design for other exports. You can enter the design name after clicking \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
