helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094				0	en-ZA	This page is only visible if the document is linked to a database. It specifies whether the reference values should be saved in the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	en-ZA	Indicate where to save the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"reference values\"\>reference values\</link\>. A reference value can represent the current state of the group box in a database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828				0	en-ZA	This page is only displayed if the document is already linked to a database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152551				0	en-ZA	Do you want to save the value in a database field?				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154823				0	en-ZA	Yes, I want to save it in the following database field:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_YES\"\>Specifies that you want to save the reference values in a database.\</ahelp\> The values are written in the data field selected in the list box. The list box displays all the field names from the database table that the form is linked to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145382				0	en-ZA	List box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_LB_STOREINFIELD\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the data field in which the reference values have to be saved.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153881				0	en-ZA	No, I only want to save the value in the form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_NO\"\>Specifies that you want to save the reference values in the form only, and not in the database.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
