helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01170400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C5				0	en-ZA	Make this address book available to all modules in %PRODUCTNAME				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01170400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C9				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Registers the newly created database file in %PRODUCTNAME. The database will then be listed in the data source window (F4). If this check box is cleared, the database will be available only by opening the database file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
