helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10564				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/purchase.xhp\"\>Purchase %PRODUCTNAME\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	en-ZA	This wizard is visible for the evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME. If you are using a time-limited evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME, you can purchase a licence online. You will get a serial number to change your %PRODUCTNAME to a full version.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10577				0	en-ZA	The wizard can be called any time from the Help menu. The wizard will be offered automatically starting five days before the evaluation period expires.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	en-ZA	The wizard consists of the following steps:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	en-ZA	Purchase %PRODUCTNAME				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is the welcome page of the wizard. If you want to buy a serial number online, click the button. If you already have a serial number, click Next to enter the number on the next page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	en-ZA	Get your serial number online				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to enter a web page, where you can purchase a serial number online.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	en-ZA	Unlock %PRODUCTNAME				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A7				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter your serial number or copy and paste the number from the online web page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	en-ZA	Licence Agreement				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BA				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Please read the licence text (scroll down the text accordingly), then accept the licence to continue unlocking. If you do not accept the licence, the software will not be unlocked.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C9				0	en-ZA	Personal Data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CD				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This step of the wizard appears when the unlocking program finds an installed version of %PRODUCTNAME where some user settings can be copied to the new installation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DC				0	en-ZA	Copy personal data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E0				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select this box to copy your user name and other data from a previous installation to your new installation of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
