helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055C				0	en-ZA	The Start-up Wizard opens when you start %PRODUCTNAME for the first time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055F				0	en-ZA	The wizard consists of the following pages:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	en-ZA	Welcome				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Start-up Wizard helps you to specify the user settings for %PRODUCTNAME. This wizard only runs once.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10575				0	en-ZA	Licence				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read and accept the licence text to continue. You need to scroll to the end of the licence text before you can continue. If you decline the licence, the installation is cancelled.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10588				0	en-ZA	Migration				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can use this page to import user data from a previously installed version of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059F				0	en-ZA	Copy personal data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Copies the user name and other data from a previous %PRODUCTNAME installation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B2				0	en-ZA	User name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The user name is used for the document properties, templates, and when you record changes made to documents. This page is only displayed if a previous installation of %PRODUCTNAME is not found on your computer.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
