helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	en-ZA	Double-click an open folder to close it and hide the subfolders and Help pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3150255\" src=\"sfx2/res/hlpdoc.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150255\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3152909				0	en-ZA	Double-click a document icon to display the corresponding Help page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	en-ZA	Use the arrow keys in combination with the Return key to drop down and roll up entries and to open documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
