helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Icons in the Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Icons in the Documentation\"\>Icons in the Documentation\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	en-ZA	Icons in the Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	en-ZA	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	en-ZA	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	en-ZA	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	en-ZA	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Index - Keyword Search in the Help				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149428				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>Index tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; keywords\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"00000130\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index - Keyword Search in the Help\"\>Index - Keyword Search in the Help\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_INDEX_CB_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Double-click an entry or type the word you want to find in the index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3148668				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_INDEX_PB_OPEN_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to display the selected topic.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	en-ZA	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	en-ZA	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	en-ZA	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"00000110\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window\"\>The \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help Window\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	en-ZA	The Help system for all versions of the software is based on the same source files. Some of the functions described in Help may not be included in this particular distribution. Some features specific to a distribution may not be mentioned in this Help.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HelpOnHelp\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Provides an overview of the Help system\</ahelp\>The Help window shows the currently selected Help page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
