helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151330				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the Increase Indent icon to increase the left indent of the current paragraph or cell content and set it to the next default tab position.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
