helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormFiltered\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Switches between the filtered and unfiltered view of the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149999				0	en-ZA	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formfiltered.png\" id=\"img_id3146130\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146130\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	en-ZA	Apply Filter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226	4			0	en-ZA	The\<emph\> Apply Filter \</emph\>function retains \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12110000.xhp\" name=\"form-based filters\"\>form-based filters\</link\> that have been set. You do not need to redefine them.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Run SQL command directly				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151100				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/14030000.xhp\" name=\"Run SQL command directly\"\>Run SQL command directly\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SbaNativeSql\"\>In Native SQL mode you can enter SQL commands that are not interpreted by $[officename], but are instead passed directly to the data source.\</ahelp\> If you do not display these changes in the design view, you cannot change back to the design view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149999				0	en-ZA	For native SQL, the SQL string is forwarded directly to the connected database system without a previous evaluation by $[officename]. For example, if you access a database through an ODBC interface, the SQL string is passed to the ODBC driver and processed by it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3147226\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sbanativesql.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147226\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155893				0	en-ZA	Run SQL command directly				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	en-ZA	Click the icon again to return to normal mode, in which the changes in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"New Query Design\"\>New Query Design\</link\> are synchronised with the permitted changes through SQL.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Move Up				2002-02-02 02:02:02
