helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152594				0	en-ZA	You can also call the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> by selecting \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>View - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>View - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>View - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>View - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>View - Navigator\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
