helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151299				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/24010000.xhp\" name=\"Graphic Filter Bar\"\>Graphic Filter Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
