helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterInvert\"\>Inverts the colour values of a colour image, or the brightness values of a greyscale image. Apply the filter again to revert the effect.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
