helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159399				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterSmooth\"\>Softens or blurs the image by applying a low pass filter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
