helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterSobel\"\>Displays the image as a charcoal sketch. The contours of the image are drawn in black, and the original colours are suppressed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
