helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterRelief\"\>Displays a dialogue for creating reliefs.\</ahelp\> You can choose the position of the imaginary light source that determines the type of shadow created, and how the graphic image looks in relief.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154756				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154256\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfilterrelief.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154256\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
