helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166447				0	en-ZA	Light Source				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145295				0	en-ZA	Specifies the light source position. A dot represents the light source.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146919				0	en-ZA	Mosaic				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163807				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterMosaic\"\>Joins small groups of pixels into rectangular areas of the same colour.\</ahelp\> The larger the individual rectangles are, the fewer details the graphic image has.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
