helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155901				0	en-ZA	Mosaic				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153922				0	en-ZA	Element resolution				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150646				0	en-ZA	Determines the number of pixels to be joined into rectangles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159336				0	en-ZA	Width				2002-02-02 02:02:02
