helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149735				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVX_GRFFILTER_DLG_MOSAIC_DLG_FILTERMOSAIC_MTR_HEIGHT\"\>Defines the height of the individual tiles.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157972				0	en-ZA	Enhance edges				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151216				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVX_GRFFILTER_DLG_MOSAIC_DLG_FILTERMOSAIC_CBX_EDGES\"\>Enhances, or sharpens, the edges of the object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Events				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150499				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>forms; events\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>events;in forms\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150499				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170202.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147043				0	en-ZA	The\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page, allows you to assign a macro to certain events which occur in a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	en-ZA	To link an event with a macro, first write a macro that contains all the commands to be executed when the event happens. Then assign this macro to the respective event by clicking the \<emph\>... \</emph\>button beside the corresponding event. The\<emph\> Assign Macro \</emph\>dialogue opens, where you can select the macro.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	en-ZA	The following actions can be configured individually, meaning that you can use your own dialogues to depict an action:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	en-ZA	Displaying an error message,				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	en-ZA	Confirming a delete process (for data records),				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	en-ZA	Querying parameters,				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155261				0	en-ZA	Checking input when saving a data record.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	en-ZA	For example, you can issue a "confirm deletion" request such as "Really delete customer xyz?" when deleting a data record.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200920562590				0	en-ZA	The events that are shown in the Events dialogue cannot be edited directly. You can delete an event from the list by pressing the Del key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150986				0	en-ZA	The following lists and describes all events in a form that can be linked to a macro:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147559				0	en-ZA	Before update				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Before update event occurs before the control content changed by the user is written into the data source.\</ahelp\> The linked macro can, for example, prevent this action by returning "FALSE".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153779				0	en-ZA	After update				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_AFTERUPDATE\"\>The After update event occurs after the control content changed by the user has been written into the data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157909				0	en-ZA	Prior to reset				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390	51			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVERESETTED\"\>The\<emph\> Prior to reset \</emph\>event occurs before a form is reset.\</ahelp\> The linked macro can, for example, prevent this action by returning "FALSE".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149236				0	en-ZA	A form is reset if one of the following conditions is met:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	en-ZA	The user presses an (HTML) button that is defined as a reset button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153666				0	en-ZA	A new and empty record is created in a form that is linked to a data source. For example, in the last record, the \<emph\>Next Record\</emph\> button may be pressed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156119				0	en-ZA	After resetting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563	55			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_RESETTED\"\>The\<emph\> After resetting \</emph\>event occurs after a form has been reset.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150870				0	en-ZA	Before submitting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159152	28			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_SUBMITTED\"\>The\<emph\> Before submitting \</emph\>event occurs before the form data is sent.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149167				0	en-ZA	When loading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423	6			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_LOADED\"\>The\<emph\> When loading \</emph\>event occurs directly after the form has been loaded.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	en-ZA	Before reloading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	39			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_RELOADING\"\>The\<emph\> Before reloading \</emph\>event occurs before the form is reloaded.\</ahelp\> The data content has not yet been refreshed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155102				0	en-ZA	When reloading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3157895	41			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_RELOADED\"\>The\<emph\> When reloading \</emph\>event occurs directly after the form has been reloaded.\</ahelp\> The data content has already been refreshed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152792				0	en-ZA	Before unloading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598	43			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_UNLOADING\"\>The\<emph\> Before unloading \</emph\>event occurs before the form is unloaded; that is, separated from its data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154145				0	en-ZA	When unloading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	45			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_UNLOADED\"\>The\<emph\> When unloading \</emph\>event occurs directly after the form has been unloaded; that is, separated from its data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147426				0	en-ZA	Confirm deletion				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154988	26			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CONFIRMDELETE\"\>The\<emph\> Confirm deletion \</emph\>event occurs as soon as data has been deleted from the form.\</ahelp\> For example, the linked macro can request confirmation in a dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149481				0	en-ZA	Before record action				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156007	58			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEROWCHANGE\"\>The\<emph\> Before record action \</emph\>event occurs before the current record is changed.\</ahelp\> For example, the linked macro can request confirmation in a dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145749				0	en-ZA	After record action				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	59			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ROWCHANGE\"\>The\<emph\> After record action \</emph\>event occurs directly after the current record has been changed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154012				0	en-ZA	Before record change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664	60			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_POSITIONING\"\>The\<emph\> Before record change \</emph\>event occurs before the current record pointer is changed.\</ahelp\>. For example, the linked macro can prevent this action by returning "FALSE".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157975				0	en-ZA	After record change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098	61			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_POSITIONED\"\>The\<emph\> After record change \</emph\>event occurs directly after the current record pointer has been changed.\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151076				0	en-ZA	Fill parameters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEPARAMETER\"\>The\<emph\> Fill parameters \</emph\>event occurs when the form to be loaded has parameters that must be filled out.\</ahelp\> For example, the data source of the form can be the following SQL command:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148773				0	en-ZA	SELECT * FROM address WHERE name=:name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149581				0	en-ZA	Here :name is a parameter that must be filled out when loading. The parameter is automatically filled out from the parent form if possible. If the parameter cannot be filled out, this event is called and a linked macro can fill out the parameter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146926				0	en-ZA	Error occurred				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485	10			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ERROROCCURED\"\>The\<emph\> Error occurred \</emph\>event is activated if an error occurs when accessing the data source.\</ahelp\> This applies to forms, list boxes and combo boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Blue				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147588				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/24050000.xhp\" name=\"Blue\"\>Blue\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafBlue\"\>Specifies the proportion of blue RGB colour components for the selected graphic.\</ahelp\> Values from -100% (no blue) to +100% (full blue) are possible.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
