helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_JOINSH_ADDTAB_CLOSE\"\>Closes the \<emph\>Add Tables\</emph\> dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	URL Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147588				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09010000.xhp\" name=\"URL Name\"\>URL Name\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150476				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_NAME\"\>Assigns a name to an Internet URL or file.\</ahelp\> You can also enter search criteria for an Internet search site.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	en-ZA	Possible search syntax is as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154673				0	en-ZA	"Suite+Office"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	en-ZA	Finds all pages that contain the words "Suite" AND "Office" at any position.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	en-ZA	"Suite,Office"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	en-ZA	Finds all pages that contain "Suite" OR "Office".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	en-ZA	Suite Office				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153346				0	en-ZA	Finds all pages that contain the specified text. Search text without quotation marks will be sent directly to the specified search engine in the Internet. In most cases, a search engine combines a string of words with "OR," and finds pages in which at least one of the words appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	en-ZA	Not all Internet \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#suchmaschine\" name=\"search engines\"\>search engines\</link\> support all logical combinations. It is recommended to use only one of the three options for linking search terms.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Find				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154228				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09050000.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_SEARCH\"\>Click and choose one of the Internet search engines from the submenu. The search term is entered in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> The list of search engines in the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> submenu is defined in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020200.xhp\" name=\"Internet - Search\"\>Internet - Search\</link\>\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	en-ZA	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recsearch.png\" id=\"img_id3153750\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153750\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	en-ZA	Find				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153683				0	en-ZA	List of search engines				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	en-ZA	When you have selected a search engine, $[officename] transfers the search request to your standard web browser, which then establishes an Internet connection to the search engine and displays the result. See also \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09010000.xhp\" name=\"URL Name\"\>URL Name\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
