helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafContrast\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the contrast for viewing the selected graphic image.\</ahelp\> Values from -100% (no contrast at all) to +100% (full contrast) are possible.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
