helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\04210000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145772				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05120200.xhp\" name=\"Optimal Column Width\"\>Optimal Column Width\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
