helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155619				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/20030000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom\"\>Zoom\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:StateZoom\"\>Specifies the current page display zoom factor.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150935				0	en-ZA	Double-clicking this field opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/03010000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom\"\>Zoom\</link\> dialogue, where you can change the current zoom factor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	en-ZA	Open the context menu on this field to see a selection of available zoom factors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Comparison Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148983				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>comparisons;operators in standard filter dialogue\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>operators;standard filters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>standard filters;comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>equal sign, see also operators\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148983				0	en-ZA	Comparison Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	en-ZA	The following comparative operators can be set under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Standard Filter\</item\> dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313	3			0	en-ZA	                  \<emph\>Comparative operator\</emph\>               				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089	4			0	en-ZA	                  \<emph\>Effect\</emph\>               				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	en-ZA	Equal (=)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	en-ZA	Shows values equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	en-ZA	Less than (<)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	en-ZA	Shows values less than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807				0	en-ZA	Greater than (>)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	en-ZA	Shows values greater than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	en-ZA	Less than or equal to (< =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381				0	en-ZA	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	en-ZA	Greater than or equal to (> =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	en-ZA	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	en-ZA	Not equal (< >)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	en-ZA	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	en-ZA	Largest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	en-ZA	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) largest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	en-ZA	Smallest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	en-ZA	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) smallest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	en-ZA	Largest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161645				0	en-ZA	Shows the largest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the total values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202				0	en-ZA	Smallest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	en-ZA	Shows the smallest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the entire values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
