helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	en-ZA	To remove the current filter, click \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12040000.xhp\" name=\"Remove Filter/Sorting\"\>\<emph\>Remove Filter/Sorting\</emph\>\</link\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
