helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Refresh\"\>Refreshes the displayed data.\</ahelp\> In a multi-user environment, refreshing the data ensures that it remains current.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147261				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3153910\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_reload.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153910\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	en-ZA	Refresh				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345	4			0	en-ZA	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Refresh \</emph\>icon to open a submenu with the following commands:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Refresh\</emph\> - Displays the refreshed contents of the database table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Rebuild\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_BROWSER_REFRESH_REBUILDVIEW\"\>Rebuilds the view of the database table. Use this command when you have changed the structure of the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Sort Ascending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152594				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/12010000.xhp\" name=\"Sort Ascending\"\>Sort Ascending\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150693	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sorts the data of the selected field in ascending order. \</ahelp\>Text fields are sorted alphabetically, numerical fields are sorted by number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3147276\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sortascending.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147276\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	en-ZA	Sort Ascending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154380	4			0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"selektionsortieren\"\>Data of the currently selected field are always sorted. A field is always selected as soon as you place the cursor in the field. To sort within tables, you can also click the corresponding column header. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	5			0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"dialogsortieren\"\>To sort more than one data field, choose \<emph\>Data - Sort\</emph\>, then choose the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100100.xhp\" name=\"Sort Criteria\"\>Sort Criteria\</link\> tab, where you can combine several sort criteria. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Edit File				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153089				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>write protection on/off\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>protected documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>documents; read-only\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>read-only documents; editing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cursor;in read-only text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>read-only documents;cursor\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Edit File icon\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148520				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/07070000.xhp\" name=\"Edit File\"\>Edit File\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153089	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditDoc\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enables you to edit a read-only document or database table.\</ahelp\> Use the\<emph\> Edit File\</emph\> icon to activate or deactivate the edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154751\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_editdoc.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154751\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150694				0	en-ZA	Edit File				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576	7			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TEXT_SELECTION_MODE\"\>You can enable a selection cursor in a read-only text document or in the Help. Choose \<emph\>Edit - Select Text \</emph\>or open the context menu of a read-only document and choose \<emph\>Select Text\</emph\>. The selection cursor does not blink.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Setting Tabs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148668				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/13010000.xhp\" name=\"Setting Tabs\"\>Setting Tabs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	en-ZA	On the ruler, set the tabs for the current paragraph, or all selected paragraphs, using the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	en-ZA	Initially the default tabs are shown on the horizontal ruler. Once you set a tab, only the default tabs to the right of the tab that you have set are available.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Tab Order				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tab Order\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150347	2			0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"text\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TabDialog\"\>In the\<emph\> Tab Order \</emph\>dialogue you can modify the order in which control fields get the focus when the user presses the tab key.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	en-ZA	If form elements are inserted into a document, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically determines in which order to move from one control to the next when using the Tab key. Every new control added is automatically placed at the end of this series. In the \<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\> dialogue, you can adapt the order of this series to your individual needs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	en-ZA	You can also define the index of a control through its specific properties by entering the desired value under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Order\"\>\<emph\>Order\</emph\>\</link\> in the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialogue of the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	en-ZA	A radio button inside a group can only be accessed by the Tab key when one of the radio buttons is set to "selected". If you have designed a group of radio buttons where no button is set to "selected", then the user will not be able to access the group or any of the radio buttons by keyboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	en-ZA	Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789	5			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABORDER_CONTROLS\"\>Lists all controls in the form. These controls can be selected with the tab key in the given order from top to bottom.\</ahelp\> Select a control from the \<emph\>Controls \</emph\>list to assign the desired position in the tab order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	en-ZA	Move Up				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	7			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_UP\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Up\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position higher in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	en-ZA	Move Down				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823	9			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_DOWN\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Down\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position lower in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154288				0	en-ZA	Automatic Sort				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	11			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_AUTO_ORDER\"\>Click the\<emph\> Automatic Sort\</emph\> button to automatically sort the controls according to their position in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Internet URLs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154094				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09020000.xhp\" name=\"Internet URLs\"\>Internet URLs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_URL\"\>Allows you to either type a URL, or insert a URL from a document using drag-and-drop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894				0	en-ZA	You can edit the URL and insert it at the current cursor position in the active document with the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon. The \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon can only be activated if the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field contains text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070300.xhp\" name=\"Document\"\>Document\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	en-ZA	Hyperlinks to any document or targets in documents can be edited using the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab from the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialogue\"\>Hyperlink dialogue\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150808				0	en-ZA	Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150710				0	en-ZA	Path				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id9462263				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter a URL for the file that you want to open when you click the hyperlink. If you do not specify a target frame, the file opens in the current document or frame.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136				0	en-ZA	Open File				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095	7			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_DOCUMENT:BTN_FILEOPEN\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Open dialogue,\</emph\> where you can select a file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149828				0	en-ZA	Target in document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145071				0	en-ZA	Target				2002-02-02 02:02:02
