helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147242				0	en-ZA	Target in Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_DOCUMENT:BTN_BROWSE\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Target in Document\</emph\> dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153320				0	en-ZA	URL				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	en-ZA	Specifies the URL, which results from the entries in \<emph\>Path\</emph\> and \<emph\>Destination\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09060000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Target Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152895				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09060000.xhp\" name=\"Target Frame\"\>Target Frame\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156211				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_TARGET\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the target frame type for the specified URL.\</ahelp\> A submenu opens with \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01100500.xhp\" name=\"predefined frames\"\>predefined frames\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149180				0	en-ZA	\<image src=\"res/target.png\" id=\"img_id3154186\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154186\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
