helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144740				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Turns the edit mode for the current database table on or off.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3152801\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_editdoc.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152801\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	en-ZA	Edit Data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149388				0	en-ZA	Editing Databases in Networks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	en-ZA	To make changes in a database used by more than one person, you must have the appropriate access rights. When you edit an external database, there is no intermediate storage by $[officename] of the changes made. They are sent directly to the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Form Properties				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147285				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>forms; properties\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>properties; forms\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088	2			0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"form\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormProperties\" visibility=\"visible\"\>In this dialogue you can specify, among others,  the data source and the events for the whole form.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Stars and Banners				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055A				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/stars.xhp\"\>Stars and Banners\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Stars and Banners toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon on the Stars and Banners toolbar, and then drag in the document to draw the shape.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	en-ZA	Some shapes have a special handle which you can drag to change the properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Combo Box Wizard: Database Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144740				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170904.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box Wizard: Database Field\"\>Combo Box Wizard: Database Field\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	en-ZA	With the combination fields, you can either save the value of a field in a database or display this value in a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	en-ZA	The user values entered in the combination field or selected in the list can be saved in the database table that is accessed in the form. Note that the saving of values in another table is not possible. If the values are not to be saved in a database, they will be saved only in the form. This is especially helpful in HTML forms, where the user's entered or selected values are to be assigned to a server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149760				0	en-ZA	Do you want to save the value in a database field?				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	en-ZA	Two options are available for this question:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153394				0	en-ZA	Yes, I want to save it in the following database field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3147043				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_YES\"\>Specifies whether the user's entered or selected combination field value should be saved in a database field.\</ahelp\> Several database table fields are offered which can be accessed in the current form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3145212				0	en-ZA	In \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control - Properties\"\>Control - Properties\</link\> the selected field appears as an entry in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page under \<emph\>Data field\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149177				0	en-ZA	List field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_LB_STOREINFIELD\"\>Specifies the data field where the combination field value should be saved.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	en-ZA	No, I only want to save the value in the form				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_NO\"\>Specifies that the value of this combination field will not be written in the database and will only be saved in the form.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
