helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Mail & News				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147102				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070200.xhp\" name=\"Mail News\"\>Mail & News\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049				0	en-ZA	On the \<emph\>Mail & News\</emph\> page in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialogue\"\>Hyperlink dialogue\</link\> you can edit hyperlinks for e-mail or news addresses.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153528				0	en-ZA	Mail & News				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153748				0	en-ZA	E-mail				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_MAIL\"\>Assigns the specified e-mail address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the new hyperlink in the document will open a new message document, addressed to the receiver specified in the \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	en-ZA	News				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_NEWS\"\>Assigns a news address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the hyperlink in the document will open a new message document to the news group you entered in the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149580				0	en-ZA	Receiver				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERDLG_MAIL_PATH\"\>Specifies the full URL of the addressee, in the form mailto:name@provider.com or news:group.server.com.\</ahelp\> You can also use drag-and-drop.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143270				0	en-ZA	Data Sources				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_IMAGEBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_BTN_ADRESSBOOK\"\>Hides or shows the data source browser.\</ahelp\> Drag the receiver's \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> data field from the data source browser into the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> text field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153332				0	en-ZA	Subject				2002-02-02 02:02:02
