helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149893	5			0	en-ZA	The\<emph\> Run Query \</emph\>function allows you to check the query. When you save the query, it is stored in the \<emph\>Query\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>View - Preview\</emph\> to run the query from the menu bar of a query design window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
