helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	en-ZA	Greyscale				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	en-ZA	The graphic object is shown in greyscale. A colour graphic object can become monochrome in greyscale. You can also use the colour sliders to apply a uniform colour to the monochrome graphic object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
