helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148755				0	en-ZA	Reset				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149651				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_RESET_BTN\"\>Resets changes made to the current tab to those applicable when this dialogue was opened. A confirmation query does not appear when you close the dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143278				0	en-ZA	Reset				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_RESET_BTN\"\>Resets modified values back to the default values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154331				0	en-ZA	A confirmation query does not appear. If you confirm the dialogue with OK all settings in this dialogue are reset.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145173				0	en-ZA	Standard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154153				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_STANDARD_BTN\"\>Resets the values visible in the dialogue back to the default installation values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154299				0	en-ZA	A confirmation does not appear before the defaults are reloaded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147502				0	en-ZA	Back				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_STANDARD_BTN\"\>View the selections in the dialogue made in the previous step. The current settings remain unchanged.\</ahelp\> This button can only be activated from page two on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147352				0	en-ZA	More				2002-02-02 02:02:02
