helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3153383				0	en-ZA	Cuts out the selected object and stores it on the clipboard. The object can be reinserted from the clipboard by using \<emph\>Paste\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156069				0	en-ZA	Paste				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154896				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_PASTE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the element that you moved to the clipboard into the document.\</ahelp\> This command can only be called if the contents of the clipboard can be inserted at the current cursor position.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149948				0	en-ZA	Insert				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3147588				0	en-ZA	Opens a submenu in the Gallery where you can choose between \<emph\>Copy\</emph\> and \<emph\>Link\</emph\>. The selected Gallery object is either copied into the current document or a link is created.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3146130				0	en-ZA	If you have selected an object in your document, then a new insertion will replace the selected object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145829				0	en-ZA	Background				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149180				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_MN_BACKGROUND\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the selected picture as a background graphic.\</ahelp\> Use the submenu commands \<emph\>Page\</emph\> or \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> to define whether the graphic should cover the entire page or only the current paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153049				0	en-ZA	Copy				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_COPY\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Copies the selected element to the clipboard.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148620				0	en-ZA	Delete				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_DESTROY\"\>Deletes the current selection. If multiple objects are selected, all will be deleted. In most cases, a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/03150100.xhp\" name=\"security query\"\>security query\</link\> appears before objects are deleted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	en-ZA	The object is either physically deleted from the data carrier or the object display is removed, depending on context.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	en-ZA	If you choose \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> while in the Gallery, the entry will be deleted from the Gallery, but the file itself will remain untouched.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150443				0	en-ZA	Open				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	137			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_OPEN_OBJECT\"\>Use the\<emph\> Open \</emph\>command to open the selected object in a new task.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149732				0	en-ZA	Rename				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enables a selected object to be renamed.\</ahelp\> After selecting \<emph\>Rename\</emph\> the name is selected and a new one can be entered directly. Use the arrow keys to set the cursor at the beginning or end of the name to delete or add to part of the name or to reposition the cursor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155434				0	en-ZA	Update				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154898				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_ACTUALIZE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Updates the view in the window or in the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147573				0	en-ZA	Preview				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3155583				0	en-ZA	The element selected is displayed in the Gallery at maximum size. Double-click the preview to switch back to the normal Gallery view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157809				0	en-ZA	Create Link				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3153716				0	en-ZA	This command can be activated if an object is selected. A link named "Link to xxx" (\<emph\>xxx\</emph\> represents the name of the object) will be created directly in the same directory as that of the selected object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
