helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	en-ZA	A grey border appears around the chart and the menu bar now contains commands for editing the objects in the chart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>Format - Axis\</emph\>, then select the axis (or axes) that you would like to edit. A dialogue appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	en-ZA	Select from the available sections and make the required changes (for example, select the \<emph\>Scale\</emph\> tab if you want to modify the scale of the axis).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
