helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\measurement_units.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	en-ZA	You can select separate measurement units for $[officename] Writer, $[officename] Writer/Web, $[officename] Calc, $[officename] Impress and $[officename] Draw documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\measurement_units.xhp	0	help	par_idN10674				0	en-ZA	Open a document of the type for which you want to change the measurement units.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\measurement_units.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
