helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\measurement_units.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	en-ZA	On the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page, select the measurement unit. Close the dialogue with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
