helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2891933				0	en-ZA	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to create a new report with the current data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id6142765				0	en-ZA	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to either see again the static snapshot of the data from first creation time, or to create a new report with the current data. This depends on your choice on the last page of the wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1757560				0	en-ZA	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to open the Report Builder window, with the report's information loaded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4649189				0	en-ZA	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to edit the Writer template file that was used to create the report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
