helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154186				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>charts;copying with link to source cell range\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting; cell ranges from spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pasting;cell ranges from spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations;inserting spreadsheet cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text documents;inserting spreadsheet cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables in spreadsheets;copying data to other applications\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
