helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar can be used to search for the selected text in the Internet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
