helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	en-ZA	Enter the text you want to find in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	en-ZA	If you select text in your document, the text is automatically entered.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	en-ZA	Click the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> icon to open a submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
