helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CB				0	en-ZA	This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/dabawiz00.xhp\"\>Database Wizard\</link\>, where you create a new database file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DD				0	en-ZA	In the Database Wizard, select the type of database, and select the option to open the Table Wizard as the next wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E0				0	en-ZA	The \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/tablewizard00.xhp\"\>Table Wizard\</link\> helps you to add a table to the new database file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FC				0	en-ZA	\<embedvar href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/main.xhp#base\"/\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
