helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023	17			0	en-ZA	In dBASE format, deleted records remain in the file. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	en-ZA	To view any changes that you make to the database, close the connection to the database, and then reconnect the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
