helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055C				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Query Wizard helps you to design a database query.\</ahelp\> The saved query can be called later, either from the graphical user interface, or using the automatically created SQL language command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D2				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/querywizard01.xhp\" name=\"Query Wizard - Field Selection\"\>Query Wizard - Field selection\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
