helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10543				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/querywizard07.xhp\"\>Query Wizard - Aliases\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10553				0	en-ZA	Assigns aliases to field names. Aliases are optional, and can provide more user-friendly names, which are displayed in place of field names. For example, an alias can be used when fields from different tables have the same name.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10556				0	en-ZA	Alias				2002-02-02 02:02:02
