helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropadd.xhp	0	help	par_idN10651				0	en-ZA	Text and dBASE databases are restricted to character sets with a fixed-size character length, where all characters are encoded with the same number of bytes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
