helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Some databases track changes to each record by assigning version number to fields that are changed. This number is incremented by 1 each time the field is changed. Displays the internal version number of the record in the database table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
