helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149207				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"indipraesent\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CustomShowDialog\"\>Defines a custom slide show using slides within the current presentation. You can then pick slides to meet the needs of your audience. You can create as many custom slide shows as you want.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155530				0	en-ZA	Name of the presentation(s)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156449				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD_LISTBOX_DLG_CUSTOMSHOW_LB_CUSTOMSHOWS\"\>Lists the custom slide shows that are available.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149408				0	en-ZA	To create a custom slide show, click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152899				0	en-ZA	Use Custom Slide Show				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149947				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD_CHECKBOX_DLG_CUSTOMSHOW_CBX_USE_CUSTOMSHOW\"\>Runs the custom slide show you selected when you click \<emph\>Start\</emph\>. Otherwise, the entire presentation is shown.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148604				0	en-ZA	To run a custom slide show:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153250				0	en-ZA	Click the show in the list and then select \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159230				0	en-ZA	Click \<emph\>Start\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
