helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157907				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_CUSTOMSHOW_BTN_STARTSHOW\"\>Runs the slide show. Ensure that \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\> is selected if you want to run a custom presentation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
