helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Connect\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Creates a line or Bézier curve by connecting two or more lines, Bézier curves, or other objects with a line.\</ahelp\> Closed objects containing a fill are converted to lines and lose their fill.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
