helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SummaryPage\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Creates a new slide that contains a bulleted list from the titles of the slides that follow the selected slide. The summary slide is inserted behind the last slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
