helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id9635914				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>In the submenu you can choose to display a list of all shapes or only the named shapes. Use drag-and-drop in the list to reorder the shapes. When you set the focus to a slide and press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Tab\</item\> key, the next shape in the defined order is selected.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
