helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145593				0	en-ZA	Auto				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149509	95			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:RBT_AUTO\"\>Restarts the slide show after the pause interval you specify. A pause slide is displayed between the final slide and the start slide. Press the Esc key to stop the show.\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150862				0	en-ZA	Duration of pause				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:TIMEFIELD:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:TMF_PAUSE\"\>Enter the duration of the pause before the slide show is repeated. If you enter zero, the show restarts immediately without showing a pause slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166420				0	en-ZA	Show logo				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:CBX_AUTOLOGO\"\>Displays the $[officename] logo on the pause slide.\</ahelp\> The logo cannot be exchanged.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
