helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154016				0	en-ZA	To insert specific elements from a file:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749	4			0	en-ZA	Click the plus sign next to the file name and select the elements you want to insert. Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to add to or Shift to expand your selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
