helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145252				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChangePolygon\"\>Converts the selected object to a polygon (a closed object bounded by straight lines).\</ahelp\> The appearance of the object does not change. If you want, you can right-click and choose \<link href=\"text/shared/main0227.xhp\" name=\"Edit Points\"\>\<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\>\</link\> to view the changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155066				0	en-ZA	Convert to Polygon				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153713				0	en-ZA	The following options are required to convert a bitmap image to a polygon. The converted image is actually a collection of smaller polygons filled with colour.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154254				0	en-ZA	Settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
