helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/04130000.xhp\" name=\"Expand Slide\"\>Expand Slide\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ExpandPage\"\>Creates a new slide from every top-level outline point (text one level below the title text in the outline hierarchy) in the selected slide. The outline text becomes the title of the new slide.\</ahelp\> Outline points below the top level on the original slide are moved up one level on the new slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146972	3			0	en-ZA	You can only use the \<emph\>Expand Slide \</emph\>command if your slide layout contains a title object and an outline object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149019				0	en-ZA	If you want to keep the original slide, choose \<emph\>Edit - Undo\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
