helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstext.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CC				0	en-ZA	Specifies the text animation settings for the current effect in the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialogue.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
