helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstext.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EE				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>All paragraphs at once\</emph\> - all paragraphs are animated at once, but can have different effects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
