helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208				0	en-ZA	In the context menu of a slide or page you find the following command, among others:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154485	5			0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>Rename Slide \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Rename Page\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148702	6			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RenamePage\"\>Renames the selected \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>slide \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>page\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04990600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Author  				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04990600.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146974				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>authors\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields; authors\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04990600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146974				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/04990600.xhp\" name=\"Author\"\>Author\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04990600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertAuthorField\"\>Inserts the first and last names listed in the $[officename] user data into the active slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04990600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154512				0	en-ZA	To edit the name, choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - User Data\"\>\<emph\>$[officename] - User Data\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Convert to 3D 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154017				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050300.xhp\" name=\"Convert to 3D\"\>Convert to 3D\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3D\"\>Converts the selected object to a three-dimensional (3D) object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147339				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"anmerkung\"\>The selected object is first converted to a contour, and then to a 3D object.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149127	3			0	en-ZA	If you select two or more objects and convert them to 3D, the result is a 3D group that acts as a single object. You can edit the individual objects in the group by choosing \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Modify\</emph\> - \<emph\>Enter Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Format - Group - Edit Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Modify – Exit Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Format – Group – Exit Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you are finished.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	en-ZA	Converting a group of objects to 3D does not change the stacking order of the individual objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146965				0	en-ZA	Press F3 to quickly enter a group and Ctrl+F3 to leave the group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145114				0	en-ZA	You can also convert bitmap images and vector graphics, including clipart, to 3D objects. $[officename] treats bitmaps as rectangles and vector graphics as a group of polygons when converting to 3D.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149876				0	en-ZA	Even drawing objects that contain text can be converted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153960				0	en-ZA	If you want, you can also apply a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05350000.xhp\" name=\"3D Effect\"\>3D Effect\</link\> to the converted object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03151000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Master Elements				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03151000.xhp	0	help	bm_id4083986				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>headers and footers;master layouts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>master layouts with headers and footers\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03151000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056D				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/03151000.xhp\"\>Master Elements\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03151000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Add header, footer, date, and slide number placeholders to the slide master.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
