helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153728				0	en-ZA	Export				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"dokuveroe\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Exports your presentation or drawing and sets the export options.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154254	4			0	en-ZA	The following file formats present you with additional export options after you click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>: 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155961				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01110000.xhp\" name=\"HTML Document\"\>HTML Document\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000202.xhp\" name=\"JPEG\"\>JPEG\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000203.xhp\" name=\"SVM/WMF/PICT/MET\"\>SVM/WMF/PICT/MET\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000204.xhp\" name=\"BMP\"\>BMP\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000205.xhp\" name=\"GIF\"\>GIF\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000213.xhp\" name=\"EPS\"\>EPS\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000212.xhp\" name=\"PNG\"\>PNG\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000214.xhp\" name=\"PBM, PPM, PGM\"\>PBM, PPM, PGM\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584				0	en-ZA	If you select "Macromedia Flash (SWF)" as file format, the current Impress or Draw document will be exported to the Macromedia Flash format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153817	7			0	en-ZA	If you choose "HTML Document" as your file format, the \<emph\>HTML Export \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01110000.xhp\" name=\"AutoPilot\"\>Wizard\</link\> appears. This wizard guides you through the export process and includes the option to save the pictures in your presentation in GIF or JPG format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148604				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070001.xhp\" name=\"Export dialogue\"\>Export dialogue\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159208				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Information on Import and Export Filters\"\>Information on Import and Export Filters\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Custom Animation Pane				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148837				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>sounds; for effects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>effects; sounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sounds; formats\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations; ordering of effects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>lists;animations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>animations;list of\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148837				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06060000.xhp\" name=\"Effects\"\>Custom Animation Pane\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144773				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"effekttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EffectWindow\"\>Assigns effects to selected objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078E				0	en-ZA	Animation List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10792				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The animation list displays all animations for the current slide. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10798				0	en-ZA	Each slide has one main animation that runs when the slide is shown.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079C				0	en-ZA	More animations may be present, which run when a shape is shown. If any of these animated shapes are present, they are listed in the lower half of the animation list. Tabs display the name of each shape that runs an animation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079F				0	en-ZA	Each list entry can consist of the following columns, from left to right:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A5				0	en-ZA	An optional + character signals that the text paragraphs are animated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	en-ZA	The second column shows the execution number of the animation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AD				0	en-ZA	Column three shows a mouse icon if the animation is started by a mouse click, and a clock if the animation starts after the previous animation ends.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B1				0	en-ZA	In column four, an icon shows the animation effect.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	en-ZA	The fifth column shows the name of the shape for this animation effect and optionally the first characters of animated text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B8				0	en-ZA	Add				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BC				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/animationeffect.xhp\"\>Custom Animation\</link\> dialogue to add another animation effect for the selected object on the slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CD				0	en-ZA	Change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D1				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/animationeffect.xhp\"\>Custom Animation\</link\> dialogue to change the animation effect for the selected entry on the animation list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E2				0	en-ZA	Remove				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E6				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Removes the selected animation effects from the animation list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E9				0	en-ZA	Start				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107ED				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the start property of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\> The following start properties are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F3				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10801				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10807				0	en-ZA	Property				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1080B				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects the additional properties of the animation. Click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to open the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialogue, where you can select and apply properties.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10820				0	en-ZA	Speed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10824				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the speed or duration of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10827				0	en-ZA	Change order				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082B				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click one of the buttons to move the selected animation effect up or down in the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082E				0	en-ZA	Play				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10832				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Plays the selected animation effect in the preview.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10835				0	en-ZA	Slide Show				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10839				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Starts the slide show from the current slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083C				0	en-ZA	Automatic preview				2002-02-02 02:02:02
