helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	2			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SD_BTN_HANDOUT\"\>Switches to the handout master page, where you can scale several slides to fit on one printed page.\</ahelp\> To modify the number of slides you can print on a page, open the \<emph\>Layouts\</emph\> task pane and double-click a layout.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
