helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155843				0	en-ZA	Cone				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143236				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Cone\"\>Draws a cone that is based on a circle where you drag in the slide. To draw a cone that is based on an oval, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3151178\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_cone.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151178\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
