helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156209				0	en-ZA	Half-Sphere				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146928				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HalfSphere\"\>Draws one half of a sphere where you drag in the slide. To draw a one half of a spheroid, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149310				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3151328\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_halfsphere.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151328\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
