helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Formatting On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150012				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>formatting;slides headings\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150012				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/11100000.xhp\" name=\"Formatting On/Off\"\>Formatting On/Off\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OutlineFormat\"\>Shows or hides the character formatting of the slide headings. To change the character formatting of a heading, open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window, right-click a style, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154254\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_outlineformat.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154254\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145789				0	en-ZA	Formatting On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Connectors				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149664				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10100000.xhp\" name=\"Connectors\"\>Connectors\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155445				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3149018\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connector.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149018\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	en-ZA	Connector				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorToolbox\"\>Open the \<emph\>Connectors\</emph\> toolbar, where you can add connectors to objects in the current slide. A connector is a line that joins objects, and remains attached when the objects are moved. If you copy an object with a connector, the connector is also copied.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658				0	en-ZA	There are four types of connector lines:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584				0	en-ZA	Standard (90-degree angle bends)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154485				0	en-ZA	Line (two bends)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153817				0	en-ZA	Straight				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149943				0	en-ZA	Curved				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148604				0	en-ZA	When you click a connector and move your mouse pointer over a filled object, or the edge of an unfilled object, gluepoints appear. A gluepoint is a fixed point where you can attach a connector line. You can add custom \<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10030200.xhp\" name=\"glue point\"\>gluepoints\</link\> to an object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762				0	en-ZA	To draw a connector line, click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release. You can also drag to an empty part of you document and click. The unattached end of the connector is locked in place, until you drag the end to a different location. To detach a connector, drag either end of the connector line to a different location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147297				0	en-ZA	Connector				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166468				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Connector\"\>Draws a connector with one or more 90-degree angle bends. Click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150743				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3153037\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connector.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153037\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153084				0	en-ZA	Connector				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145597				0	en-ZA	Connector Starts with Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorArrowStart\"\>Draws a connector with one or more 90-degree angle bends and an arrow at the starting point. Click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3150021\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connectorarrowstart.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150021\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	en-ZA	Connector Starts with Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145248				0	en-ZA	Connector Ends with Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145353				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorArrowEnd\"\>Draws a connector with one or more 90-degree angle bends and an arrow at the endpoint. Click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150930				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3150936\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connectorarrowend.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150936\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109843	17			0	en-ZA	Connector Ends with Arrow 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154865				0	en-ZA	Connector with Arrows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155374				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorArrows\"\>Draws a connector with one or more 90-degree angle bends and arrows at both ends. Click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155987				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3153720\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connectorarrows.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153720\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
