helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\13030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149666				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13030000.xhp\" name=\"Allow Effects\"\>Allow Effects\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\13030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AnimationMode\"\>Plays a preview of an animation effect that is assigned to an object, when you click the object in the slide. To select an object for editing, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key when you click.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\13030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154704				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3149129\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_animationmode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149129\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
