helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Mode				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150199				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>flipping around a flip line\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>mirroring objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>3D rotation objects; converting to\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>slanting objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects; effects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>distorting objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>shearing objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>transparency; of objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gradients; transparent\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colours; defining gradients interactively\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gradients; defining colours\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>circles; of objects\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10030000.xhp\" name=\"Mode\"\>Mode\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AdvancedMode\"\>Modifies the shape, orientation or fill of the selected object(s).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154490\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154490\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018				0	en-ZA	Effects (%PRODUCTNAME Draw only)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018	4			0	en-ZA	To open the\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw \<emph\>Mode \</emph\>toolbar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Effects \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. In %PRODUCTNAME Impress, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Mode\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150199				0	en-ZA	Rotate				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148489				0	en-ZA	Rotates or skews the selected 2D object(s) around a pivot point. Drag a corner handle of the object in the direction you want to rotate it. To skew an object, drag a centre handle in the direction you want to skew it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	en-ZA	Each slide has only one pivot point. Double-click an object to move the pivot point to the centre of the object. You can also drag the pivot point to a new location on the screen, and then rotate the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153914				0	en-ZA	If you select a group that includes a 3D object, only the 3D object is rotated. You cannot skew a 3D object, instead, you can rotate it about the X and Y axes by dragging the centre handles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146962				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3153811\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153811\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150435				0	en-ZA	Rotate				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151387				0	en-ZA	Flip				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Mirror\"\>Flips the selected object(s) around a flip line, that you can drag to anywhere on the slide. Drag a handle of the object(s) across the flip line to flip the object(s). To change the orientation of the flip line, drag one of its end points to new location.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153035				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3153932\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_mirror.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153932\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590				0	en-ZA	Flip				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155263				0	en-ZA	In 3D Rotation Object				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145169				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3DLathe\"\>Converts the selected 2D object(s) to a 3D object, by rotating the object(s) around a symmetry line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	36			0	en-ZA	Drag the symmetry line to a new location to change the shape of the converted object. To change the orientation of the symmetry line, drag one of its end points. Click the object to convert it to 3D. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150928				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3145295\" src=\"svx/res/rotate3d.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145295\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149024				0	en-ZA	In 3D Rotation Object				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147536				0	en-ZA	Set in circle (perspective)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CrookRotate\"\>Distorts the selected object by wrapping it around imaginary circles, and then adding perspective. Drag a handle of the selected object to distort it.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3083443\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_crookslant.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3083443\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149454				0	en-ZA	Set in circle (perspective)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151185				0	en-ZA	Set to circle (slant)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150766				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CrookSlant\"\>Distorts the selected object by wrapping it around imaginary circles. Drag a handle of the selected object to distort it.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150875				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3150882\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_crookrotate.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150882\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153156				0	en-ZA	Set to circle (slant)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154049				0	en-ZA	Distort				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149756				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Shear\"\>Lets you drag the handles of the selected object to change its shape.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154693				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154933\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shear.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154933\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154294				0	en-ZA	Distort				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154203				0	en-ZA	Transparency				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InteractiveTransparence\"\>Applies a transparency gradient to the selected object.\</ahelp\> The transparency line represents a a greyscale, with the black handle corresponding to 0% transparency and the white handle to 100% transparency.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147516				0	en-ZA	Drag the white handle to change the direction of the transparency gradient. Drag the black handle to change the length of the gradient. You can also drag and drop colours onto the handles from the \<emph\>Colour\</emph\> Bar to change their greyscale values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154104				0	en-ZA	To display the \<emph\>Colour Bar\</emph\>, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Color Bar\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154602				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3154790\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_interactivetransparence.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154790\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150623				0	en-ZA	Transparency				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149932				0	en-ZA	Gradient				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149594	47			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InteractiveGradient\"\>Modifies the gradient fill of the selected object. This command is only available if you applied a gradient to the selected object in \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> Drag the handles of the gradient line to change the direction of the gradient or the length of the gradient. You can also drag and drop colours onto the handles from the \<emph\>Colour\</emph\> Bar to change the colour of the gradient endpoints. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151311				0	en-ZA	To display the \<emph\>Colour Bar\</emph\>, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Colour Bar\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150990				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3151102\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_interactivegradient.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151102\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148400				0	en-ZA	Gradient				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Show/Hide Slide				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147368				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/04010000.xhp\" name=\"Show/Hide Slide\"\>Show/Hide Slide\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149883				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HideSlide\"\>Hides the selected slide so that it is not displayed during a slide show.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	en-ZA	The number of a hidden slide is crossed out. To show a hidden slide, choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Show/Hide Slide\</emph\> again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3156067\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_hideslide.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156067\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156061				0	en-ZA	Show/Hide Slide				2002-02-02 02:02:02
