helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154558				0	en-ZA	Return to previous slide				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590				0	en-ZA	\<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+PageUp\</item\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153003				0	en-ZA	Go to a specific slide				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	en-ZA	Type the page number of the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150337				0	en-ZA	Slide Sorter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153732	21			0	en-ZA	When you first switch to Slide Sorter, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> to change the keyboard focus to the workspace. Otherwise, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F6\</item\> to navigate to the workspace, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149882				0	en-ZA	Selecting and deselecting slides				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930				0	en-ZA	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to select, and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>. To add to the selection, use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide(s) that you want to add, and press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\> again. To deselect a slide, navigate to the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145248				0	en-ZA	Copying a slide:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	en-ZA	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to copy, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+C\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148769				0	en-ZA	Move to the slide where you want to paste the copied slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+V\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148388	25			0	en-ZA	Select \<emph\>Before \</emph\>or \<emph\>After\</emph\> the current slide, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155367				0	en-ZA	Moving a slide:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155987				0	en-ZA	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to move, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+X\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147171				0	en-ZA	Navigate to the slide where you want to move the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+V\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3083282	29			0	en-ZA	Select \<emph\>Before \</emph\>or \<emph\>After\</emph\> the current slide, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
