helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153337				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149051				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
