helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154799				0	en-ZA	 Returns the hyperbolic cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155422				0	en-ZA	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144754				0	en-ZA	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COTH(1)\</item\> returns the hyperbolic cotangent of 1, approximately 1.3130.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145314				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>DEGREES function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;radians, into degrees\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
