helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149939				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DEG\"\>Converts radians into degrees.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
