helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151109				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FAKULTAET\"\>Returns the factorial of a number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146902				0	en-ZA	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154661				0	en-ZA	FACT(Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	en-ZA	 Returns Number!, the factorial of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, calculated as 1*2*3*4* ... * Number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3834650				0	en-ZA	=FACT(0) returns 1 by definition. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8429517				0	en-ZA	The factorial of a negative number returns the "invalid argument" error.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
