helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154476				0	en-ZA	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FACT(3)\</item\> returns 6.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147525				0	en-ZA	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FACT(0)\</item\> returns 1.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
