helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id090720090412378				0	en-ZA	=UNICHAR(169) returns the Copyright character \<emph\>©\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id0907200904033543				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>UNICODE function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
