helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155112				0	en-ZA	Add/Modify				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_NAMES:BTN_ADD\"\>Click the \<emph\>Add\</emph\> button to add the defined name to the list. Click the \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> button to enter another name for an already existing name selected from the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
