helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154960				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_PAGE\"\>Inserts a placeholder in the selected header/footer area, which is replaced by page numbering. This allows continuous page numbering in a document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151304				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3155386\" src=\"sc/res/page.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155386\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
