helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_DBNAMES:BTN_HEADER\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Selected cell ranges contains labels.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153970				0	en-ZA	Insert or delete cells				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	6			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_DBNAMES:BTN_SIZE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Automatically inserts new rows and columns into the database range in your document when new records are added to the database.\</ahelp\> To manually update the database range, choose \<emph\>Data - Refresh\</emph\> \<emph\>Range\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153768				0	en-ZA	Keep formatting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_DBNAMES:BTN_FORMAT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Applies the existing cell format of headers and first data row to the whole database range.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856				0	en-ZA	Don't save imported data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_DBNAMES:BTN_STRIPDATA\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Only saves a reference to the database, and not the contents of the cells.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147428				0	en-ZA	Source:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	en-ZA	Displays information about the current database source and any existing operators.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
