helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3154502				0	en-ZA	0 or missing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3149877				0	en-ZA	US method (NASD), 12 months of 30 days each				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3148766				0	en-ZA	1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3154326				0	en-ZA	Exact number of days in months, exact number of days in year				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3145245				0	en-ZA	2				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	en-ZA	Exact number of days in month, year has 360 days				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3145297				0	en-ZA	3				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	en-ZA	Exact number of days in month, year has 365 days				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3151022				0	en-ZA	4				2002-02-02 02:02:02
