helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3149007				0	en-ZA	What fraction of the year 2008 lies between 2008-01-01 and 2008-07-01?				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3154632				0	en-ZA	=YEARFRAC("2008-01-01"; "2008-07-01";0) returns 0.50.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
