helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147102				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"zusaetzetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays or hides additional filtering options.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
