helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153662				0	en-ZA	Case sensitive				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	en-ZA	Distinguishes between uppercase and lowercase letters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156327				0	en-ZA	Regular Expression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	en-ZA	Allows you to use wildcards in the filter definition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	en-ZA	If the \<emph\>Regular Expression\</emph\> check box is selected, you can use EQUAL (=) and NOT EQUAL (<>) also in comparisons. You can also use the following functions: DCOUNTA, DGET, MATCH, COUNTIF, SUMIF, LOOKUP, VLOOKUP and HLOOKUP.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153379				0	en-ZA	Unique records only				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	en-ZA	Excludes duplicate rows in the list of filtered data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156282				0	en-ZA	Data area				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	en-ZA	Displays the name of the filtered data area in the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156424				0	en-ZA	More<<				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	en-ZA	Hides the additional options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100001.xhp\" name=\"List of Regular Expressions\"\>List of Regular Expressions\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Filter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153970				0	en-ZA	Filter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	en-ZA	Set the filtering options for the data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151043				0	en-ZA	Filter Criteria				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150440				0	en-ZA	You can define a default filter for the data by filtering, for example, field names, using a combination of logical expressions arguments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	en-ZA	Operator				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153093				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTFILTER:LB_OP2\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Select a logical operator for the filter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152462				0	en-ZA	Field name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTFILTER:LB_FIELD3\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Select the field that you want to use in the filter. If field names are not available, the column labels are listed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148575				0	en-ZA	Condition				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTFILTER:LB_COND3\"\>Select an operator to compare the \<emph\>Field name\</emph\> and \<emph\>Value\</emph\> entries.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	en-ZA	The following operators are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Conditions:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150324				0	en-ZA	=				2002-02-02 02:02:02
