helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3146991	122			0	en-ZA	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value for which the t-distribution is calculated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3148824	123			0	en-ZA	            \<emph\>DegreesFreedom\</emph\> is the number of degrees of freedom for the t-distribution.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
