helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	en-ZA	1st Quarter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	en-ZA	April				2002-02-02 02:02:02
