helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	en-ZA	Use the Styles and Formatting window to assign styles to objects and text sections. You can update Styles, modify existing Styles or create new Styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	en-ZA	The Styles and Formatting \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dockable window\"\>dockable window\</link\> can remain open while editing the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
