helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AuditingFillMode\"\>Activates the Fill Mode in the Detective. The mouse pointer changes to a special symbol, and you can click any cell to see a trace to the precedent cell.\</ahelp\> To exit this mode, press Escape or click the \<emph\>End Fill Mode\</emph\> command in the context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151211				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Fill Mode\</emph\> function is identical to the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06030100.xhp\" name=\"Trace Precedent\"\>Trace Precedent\</link\> command if you call this mode for the first time. Use the context menu to select further options for the Fill Mode and to exit this mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
