helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151075				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_SORT_FIELDS:BTN_DOWN1\"\>Sorts the selection from the highest value to the lowest value. You can define the sort rules on Data - Sort - Options.\</ahelp\> You define the default on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154492				0	en-ZA	Then by				2002-02-02 02:02:02
