helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	par_id3150940				0	en-ZA	EASTERSUNDAY(2000)+49 returns the internal serial number 36688. The result is 2000-06-11. Format the serial date number as a date, for example in the format YYYY-MM-DD.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
