helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_GESTEP\"\>The result is 1 if \<item type=\"literal\"\>Number\</item\> is greater than or equal to \<item type=\"literal\"\>Step\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
