helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3159176				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is a hexadecimal number. The number can have a maximum of 10 places. The most significant bit is the sign bit, the following bits return the value. Negative numbers are entered as two's complement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154304				0	en-ZA	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
