helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04040000.xhp\" name=\"Columns\"\>Columns\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertColumns\"\>Inserts a new column to the left of the active cell.\</ahelp\> The number of columns inserted corresponds to the number of columns selected. The existing columns are moved to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Up				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140300.xhp\" name=\"Up\"\>Up\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillUp\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the bottom most cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	en-ZA	If a selected range has only one column, the content of the bottom most cell is copied into the selected cells. If several columns are selected, the contents of the bottom most cells are copied into those selected above.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Navigator				2002-02-02 02:02:02
