helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Navigator\"\>Activates and deactivates the Navigator.\</ahelp\> The Navigator is a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dockable window\"\>dockable window\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	en-ZA	Choose \<emph\>View - Navigator\</emph\> to display the Navigator.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
