helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153955				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_NAVIPI_SCEN\"\>Displays all available scenarios. Double-click a name to apply that scenario.\</ahelp\> The result is shown in the sheet. For more information, choose \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06050000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Scenarios\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Scenarios\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
