helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149009				0	en-ZA	Insert as Hyperlink				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146938	30			0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_DROPMODE_URL\"\>Inserts a hyperlink when you drag-and-drop an object from the Navigator into a document.\</ahelp\> You can later click the created hyperlink to set the cursor and the view to the respective object. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3880733				0	en-ZA	If you insert a hyperlink that links to an open document, you need to save the document before you can use the hyperlink.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154682				0	en-ZA	Insert as Link				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150746				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_DROPMODE_LINK\"\>Creates a link when you drag-and-drop an object from the Navigator into a document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145824				0	en-ZA	Insert as Copy				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147471				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_DROPMODE_COPY\"\>Generates a copy when you drag-and-drop an object from the Navigator into a document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
