helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:TABPAGE:TP_VALIDATION_INPUTHELP\"\>Enter the message that you want to display when the cell or cell range is selected in the sheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
