helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730				0	en-ZA	If you enter text in the \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> box of this dialogue, and then select and clear this check box, the text will be lost.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
