helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"zielwertsuchetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GoalSeekDialog\"\>Opens a dialogue where you can solve an equation with a variable.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> After a successful search, a dialogue with the results opens, allowing you to apply the result and the target value directly to the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
