helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153088				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06030500.xhp\" name=\"Remove All Traces\"\>Remove All Traces\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
