helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Shortcut Keys for Spreadsheets				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145801				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; shortcut keys in\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>shortcut keys; spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sheet ranges; filling\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145801				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"calc_keys\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/04/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Shortcut Keys for Spreadsheets\"\>Shortcut Keys for Spreadsheets\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155067				0	en-ZA	To fill a selected cell range with the formula that you entered on the \<emph\>Input line\</emph\>, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter. Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter+Shift to apply the cell format of the input cell to the entire cell range.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153967				0	en-ZA	To create a matrix in which all the cells contain the same information as what you entered on the \<emph\>Input line\</emph\>, press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter. You cannot edit the components of the matrix.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426				0	en-ZA	To select multiple cells in different areas of a sheet, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>and drag in the different areas.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150207				0	en-ZA	To select multiple sheets in a spreadsheet, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click the name tabs at the lower edge of the workspace. To select only one sheet in a selection, hold down Shift, and then click the name tab of the sheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166432				0	en-ZA	To insert a manual line break in a cell, click in the cell, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978				0	en-ZA	To delete the contents of selected cells, press Delete. This opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Delete Contents\"\>Delete Contents\</link\> dialogue, where you choose which contents of the cell you want to delete. To delete the contents of selected cells without a dialogue, press the Backspace key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
