helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205				0	en-ZA	Moves the cursor to the first cell of the current row.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149897				0	en-ZA	End				2002-02-02 02:02:02
