helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149013				0	en-ZA	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Page Down				2002-02-02 02:02:02
