helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150770				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"main\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"Instructions for Using $[officename] Calc\"\>Instructions for Using $[officename] Calc\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	en-ZA	Formatting Tables and Cells				2002-02-02 02:02:02
