helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN1013E				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3149044\" src=\"starmath/res/co21905.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149044\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
