helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10226				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3145265\" src=\"starmath/res/co21904.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145265\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
