helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LINE_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between lines.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
