helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153627				0	en-ZA	Limits				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149755				0	en-ZA	Defines the spacing between the sum symbol and the limit conditions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147260				0	en-ZA	Upper limit				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154690				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_UPPERLIMIT_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between the sum symbol and the upper limit.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
