helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153304				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_OVERSTRIKEX\"\>Inserts a placeholder with a line (or overstrike) through it.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>overstrike <?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
