helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090907.xhp	0	help	par_id3148489				0	en-ZA	Here is an example of how to create functions with \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\>. If you want to use the example in your own formula, copy it to the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window using the clipboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
