helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148879				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_IINTX\"\>Inserts a \<emph\>double integral\</emph\> symbol with one placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>iint <?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
