helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153508				0	en-ZA	Lower Limit				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150556				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FROMX\"\>Inserts a \<emph\>lower limit\</emph\> range statement for integral and sum with placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>from {<?>}<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
