helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149839				0	en-ZA	Curve Integral				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147592				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LINTX\"\>Inserts a \<emph\>curve integral\</emph\> symbol with one placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>lint <?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_idN102E6				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3147055\" src=\"starmath/res/fo21610.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.25inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147055\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
