helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155379				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XGEY\"\>Inserts the \<emph\>greater than or equal to\</emph\> relation with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?> ge <?>\</emph\> or \<emph\><?> >= <?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
