helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155935				0	en-ZA	similar to				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155947				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XSIMY\"\>This icon inserts the \<emph\>similar to\</emph\> relation with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>sim<?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
