helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313				0	en-ZA	\<variable id=\"symboletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_SYMBOLS_CATALOGUE\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Symbols\</emph\> dialogue, in which you can select a symbol to insert in the formula.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
