helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149500				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TOOLBOX\"\>This is a list of operators, functions, symbols and format options that can be inserted into the formula.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
