helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Statement block:\</emph\> Statements that you want to repeat while or until the condition is True.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statement executes a loop as long as, or until, a certain condition is True. The condition for exiting the loop must be entered following either the \<emph\>Do\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Loop\</emph\> statement. The following examples are valid combinations:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366				0	en-ZA	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	en-ZA	Do While condition = True				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	en-ZA	...statement block				2002-02-02 02:02:02
