helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	en-ZA	The statement block between the Do While and the Loop statements is repeated so long as the condition is true.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	en-ZA	Do Until condition = True				2002-02-02 02:02:02
