helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484				0	en-ZA	Use the \<emph\>Exit Do\</emph\> statement to unconditionally end the loop. You can add this statement anywhere in a \<emph\>Do\</emph\>...\<emph\>Loop\</emph\> statement. You can also define an exit condition using the \<emph\>If...Then\</emph\> structure as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
