helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03102000.xhp\" name=\"DefVar Statement [Runtime]\"\>DefVar Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
