helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030103.xhp\" name=\"Day Function [Runtime]\"\>Day Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	en-ZA	Returns a value that represents the day of the month based on a serial date number generated by \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149456				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	en-ZA	Day (Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148798				0	en-ZA	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3125865				0	en-ZA	Integer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150448				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> A numeric expression that contains a serial date number from which you can determine the day of the month.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	en-ZA	This function is basically the opposite of the DateSerial function, returning the day of the month from a serial date number generated by the \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or the \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\> function. For example, the expression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	en-ZA	Print Day (DateSerial(1994, 12, 20))				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190				0	en-ZA	returns the value 20.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149481				0	en-ZA	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155413				0	en-ZA	sub ExampleDay				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	en-ZA	Print "Day " & Day(DateSerial(1994, 12, 20)) & " of the month"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	en-ZA	end sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
