helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149205				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120104.xhp\" name=\"Val Function [Runtime]\"\>Val Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	en-ZA	Converts a string to a numeric expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
