helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154348				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> String that represents a number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	en-ZA	Using the Val function, you can convert a string that represents numbers into numeric expressions. This is the inverse of the \<emph\>Str\</emph\> function. If only part of the string contains numbers, only the first appropriate characters of the string are converted. If the string does not contain any numbers, the \<emph\>Val\</emph\> function returns the value 0.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154365				0	en-ZA	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	en-ZA	Sub ExampleVal				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3159150				0	en-ZA	msgbox Val("123.123")				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154126				0	en-ZA	msgbox Val("A123.123")				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229				0	en-ZA	end Sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Watch Window				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149457				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01050100.xhp\"\>Watch Window\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	en-ZA	The Watch window allows you to observe the value of variables during the execution of a program. Define the variable in the Watch text box. Click on \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/02/11080000.xhp\"\>Enable Watch\</link\> to add the variable to the list box and to display its values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145173				0	en-ZA	Watch				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BASICIDE_WATCHWINDOW_EDIT\"\>Enter the name of the variable whose value is to be monitored.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148645				0	en-ZA	Remove Watch				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BASICIDE_REMOVEWATCH\"\>Removes the selected variable from the list of watched variables.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	en-ZA	\<image id=\"img_id3152460\" src=\"res/baswatr.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152460\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154012				0	en-ZA	Remove Watch				2002-02-02 02:02:02
