helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	en-ZA	If the variables are separated by commas (for example, DIM sPar1, sPar2, sPar3 AS STRING), only Variant variables can be defined. Use a separate definition line for each variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
