helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03103450.xhp\" name=\"Global Statement [Runtime]\"\>Global Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	en-ZA	Dimensions a variable or an array at the global level (that is, not within a subroutine or function), so that the variable and the array are valid in all libraries and modules for the current session.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143270				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	en-ZA	Global VarName[(start To end)] [As VarType][, VarName2[(start To end)] [As VarType][,...]]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156152				0	en-ZA	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	en-ZA	Global iGlobalVar As Integer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
