helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	en-ZA	iGlobalVar = iGlobalVar + 1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	en-ZA	MsgBox iGlobalVar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	en-ZA	End sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Choose Function [Runtime]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143271				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>Choose function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143271				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090402.xhp\" name=\"Choose Function [Runtime]\"\>Choose Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3149234				0	en-ZA	Returns a selected value from a list of arguments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148943				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	en-ZA	Choose (Index, Selection1[, Selection2, ... [,Selection_n]])				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154346				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Index:\</emph\> A numeric expression that specifies the value to return.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Selection1:\</emph\> Any expression that contains one of the possible choices.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Choose\</emph\> function returns a value from the list of expressions based on the index value. If Index = 1, the function returns the first expression in the list, if index i= 2, it returns the second expression, and so on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	en-ZA	If the index value is less than 1 or greater than the number of expressions listed, the function returns a Null value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	en-ZA	The following example uses the \<emph\>Choose\</emph\> function to select a string from several strings that form a menu:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439				0	en-ZA	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3153091				0	en-ZA	Sub ExampleChoose				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597				0	en-ZA	Dim sReturn As String				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	en-ZA	sReturn = ChooseMenu(2)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3148575				0	en-ZA	Print sReturn				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3154012				0	en-ZA	end sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3146921				0	en-ZA	Function ChooseMenu(Index As Integer)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3156443				0	en-ZA	ChooseMenu = Choose(Index, "Quick Format", "Save Format", "System Format")				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	en-ZA	End Function				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Minute Function [Runtime]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155419				0	en-ZA	\<bookmark_value\>Minute function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030202.xhp\" name=\"Minute Function [Runtime]\"\>Minute Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	en-ZA	Returns the minute of the hour that corresponds to the serial time value that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154758				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	en-ZA	Minute (Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148798				0	en-ZA	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	en-ZA	Integer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969	8			0	en-ZA	         \<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Numeric expression that contains the serial time value that is used to return the minute value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869	9			0	en-ZA	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>TimeSerial \</emph\>function. It returns the minute of the serial time value that is generated by the \<emph\>TimeSerial\</emph\> or the \<emph\>TimeValue \</emph\>function. For example, the expression:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	en-ZA	Print Minute(TimeSerial(12,30,41))				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	en-ZA	returns the value 30.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150010				0	en-ZA	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	en-ZA	Sub ExampleMinute				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	en-ZA	MsgBox "The current minute is "& Minute(Now)& "."				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	en-ZA	end sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
