helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150400				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020102.xhp\" name=\"FreeFile Function[Runtime]\"\>FreeFile Function[Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	en-ZA	Returns the next available file number for opening a file. Use this function to open a file using a file number that is not already in use by a currently open file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
