helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	en-ZA	This function can only be used immediately in front of an Open statement. FreeFile returns the next available file number, but does not reserve it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
