helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145172				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that contains an unambiguous file specification. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	en-ZA	This function determines the attributes for a specified file and returns the bit pattern that can help you to identify the following file attributes:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145364				0	en-ZA	Value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349				0	en-ZA	0 : Normal files.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	en-ZA	1 : Read-only files.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	en-ZA	8 : Returns the name of the volume				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	en-ZA	16 : Returns the name of the directory only.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020409.xhp	0	help	par_id3153953				0	en-ZA	32 : File was changed since last backup (Archive bit).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
