helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3159254				0	en-ZA	MsgBox cDate(1000.25) REM 09.26.1902 06:00:00				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155133				0	en-ZA	MsgBox cDate(1001.26) REM 09.27.1902 06:14:24				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140				0	en-ZA	end sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	Organising Libraries and Modules				2002-02-02 02:02:02
