helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154756				0	en-ZA	Print #iNumber, "This is another line of text"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148408				0	en-ZA	Close #iNumber				2002-02-02 02:02:02
