helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	en-ZA	Exits a \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\>, \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\>, a function, or a subroutine.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
