helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020401.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150178				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020401.xhp\" name=\"ChDir Statement [Runtime]\"\>ChDir Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
