helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020401.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	en-ZA	ChDir Text As String				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020401.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148664				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020401.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that specifies the directory path or drive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020401.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	en-ZA	If you only want to change the current drive, enter the drive letter followed by a colon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
