helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610				0	en-ZA	MyObj.Prop1.Command = 5				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103900.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	en-ZA	corresponds to the following command block:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
