helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	en-ZA	End, End Function, End If, End Select, End Sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149456				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	en-ZA	Use the End statement as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366				0	en-ZA	Statement				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	en-ZA	End: Is not required, but can be entered anywhere within a procedure to end the program execution.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	en-ZA	End Function: Ends a \<emph\>Function\</emph\> statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	en-ZA	End If: Marks the end of a \<emph\>If...Then...Else\</emph\> block.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	en-ZA	End Select: Marks the end of a \<emph\>Select Case\</emph\> block.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090404.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	en-ZA	End Sub: Ends a \<emph\>Sub\</emph\> statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
