helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numerical expression that contains the result of the number raised to a power.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Numerical value that you want to raise to a power.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Exponent:\</emph\> The value of the power that you want to raise the expression to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
