helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886				0	en-ZA	Print ( 12.345 ^ 23 )				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	en-ZA	Print Exp ( 23 * Log( 12.345 ) ) REM Raises by forming a logarithm				2002-02-02 02:02:02
