helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03100500.xhp\" name=\"CInt Function [Runtime]\"\>CInt Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	en-ZA	Converts any string or numeric expression to an integer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147573				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	en-ZA	CInt (Expression)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147531				0	en-ZA	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	en-ZA	Integer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145069				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to convert. If the \<emph\>Expression\</emph\> exceeds the value range between -32768 and 32767, $[officename] Basic reports an overflow error. To convert a string expression, the number must be entered as normal text ("123.5") using the default number format of your operating system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	en-ZA	This function always rounds the fractional part of a number to the nearest integer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
