helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153311				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120307.xhp\" name=\"Right Function [Runtime]\"\>Right Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	en-ZA	Returns the rightmost "n" characters of a string expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	en-ZA	See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120303.xhp\" name=\"Left Function\"\>Left Function\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
