helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120403.xhp	0	help	par_id3146796				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Compare:\</emph\> This optional parameter sets the comparison method. If Compare = 1, the string comparison is case-sensitive. If Compare = 0, no distinction is made between uppercase and lowercase letters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
