helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792				0	en-ZA	Print ASC("A") REM returns 65				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	en-ZA	Print ASC("Z") REM returns 90				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3163800				0	en-ZA	Print ASC("Las Vegas") REM returns 76, since only the first character is taken into account				2002-02-02 02:02:02
