helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090411.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153311				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090411.xhp\" name=\"With Statement [Runtime]\"\>With Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090411.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	en-ZA	Sets an object as the default object. Unless another object name is declared, all properties and methods refer to the default object until the End With statement is reached.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090411.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156153				0	en-ZA	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090411.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	en-ZA	With Object Statement block End With				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090411.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154924				0	en-ZA	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090411.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	en-ZA	Use \<emph\>With\</emph\> and \<emph\>End With\</emph\> if you have several properties or methods for a single object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
