helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080401.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156023				0	en-ZA	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080401.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	en-ZA	Double				2002-02-02 02:02:02
