helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149205				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03104600.xhp\" name=\"EqualUnoObjects Function [Runtime]\"\>EqualUnoObjects Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	en-ZA	Returns True if the two specified Basic Uno objects represent the same Uno object instance.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
