helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120311.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120311.xhp\" name=\"Trim Function [Runtime]\"\>Trim Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120311.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	en-ZA	Removes all leading and trailing spaces from a string expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
