helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101140.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Characterrange:\</emph\> Letters that specify the range of variables that you want to set a default data type for.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
