helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-ZA	IDE Overview				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147291				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01030100.xhp\" name=\"IDE Overview\"\>IDE Overview\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	en-ZA	The \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/main0211.xhp\" name=\"Macro Toolbar\"\>\<emph\>Macro Toolbar\</emph\>\</link\> in the IDE provides various icons for editing and testing programs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	en-ZA	In the \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01030200.xhp\" name=\"Editor window\"\>\<emph\>Editor window\</emph\>\</link\>, directly below the Macro toolbar, you can edit the Basic program code. The column on the left side is used to set breakpoints in the program code.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	en-ZA	The \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01050100.xhp\" name=\"Watch\"\>\<emph\>Watch window\</emph\>\</link\> (observer) is located below the Editor window at the left, and displays the contents of variables or arrays during a single step process.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	en-ZA	The \<emph\>Call Stack\</emph\> window to the right provides information about the call stack of SUBS and FUNCTIONS when a program runs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	en-ZA	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Basic IDE\"\>Basic IDE\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
