helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080601.xhp	0	help	par_id3154347				0	en-ZA	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to return the absolute value for. Positive numbers, including 0, are returned unchanged, whereas negative numbers are converted to positive numbers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080601.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381				0	en-ZA	The following example uses the Abs function to calculate the difference between two values. It does not matter which value you enter first.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
