helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150517				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select "Yes" to enable the control. If the control is disabled, it is greyed out in the dialogue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
