helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146324				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the label of the current control. The label is displayed along with the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
