helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154580				0	en-ZA	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the entries for a list control. One line takes one list entry. Press \<emph\>Shift+Enter\</emph\> to insert a new line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149723				0	en-ZA	Literal mask				2002-02-02 02:02:02
