helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	en-ZA	In a bit-wise comparison, the Eqv operator only sets the corresponding bit in the result if a bit is set in both expressions, or in neither expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
