helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\11140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445				0	en-ZA	Place the cursor in the code where you want to insert the source text, and then click the \<emph\>Insert source text\</emph\> icon. Locate the file that contains the Basic source text that you want to insert, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
