readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	mgjfg	mgjfg			0	en-ZA	Window Manager				2002-02-02 02:02:02
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	wd2dff1	wd2dff1			0	en-ZA	Gnome 2.6 or higher, with the gail 1.8.6 and the at-spi 1.7 packages, required for support of assistive technology tools (AT tools)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	s2we35	s2we35			0	en-ZA	Linux Kernel version 2.6.18 or higher				2002-02-02 02:02:02
